{"body":{"matters":"coherence without uniformity","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000002"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000R"}],"prose":"The held space is about how parts that keep their own language, logic and will can still act as a single body. It doesn't do this by giving them one center or one vocabulary. It does it by brokering meaning and priority as each moment needs it. Everything else is how that body is built, how it meets the world, and how it checks itself."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000001","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Many selves acting as one"}
{"body":{"matters":"what each part is allowed to be","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000003"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000007"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000B"}],"prose":"The whole is built from three things laid over one another: a shape of authority, a way of sharing meaning, and a set of values each made into a role of its own."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000002","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How the body is composed"}
{"body":{"matters":"who may overrule whom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000004"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000005"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000006"}],"prose":"Authority here is both nested and spread out. There is a pyramid with a top that commands, and alongside it a repeated claim that nothing sits at the center. How far each part decides for itself is a setting that can be turned up or down."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000003","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The shape of authority"}
{"body":{"matters":"rank by level of nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Higher wholes hold more authority and lower ones carry out directives within bounds. In practice the connecting holon becomes the summit, with the highest say."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000004","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A pyramid inside the holarchy"}
{"body":{"matters":"untouched interiors","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Each participant keeps its internal logic. Coordination is offered from above without reaching into any part's interior, and the mediator says it replaces no one."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000005","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"No center claimed"}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of self-direction","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"Parts can be passive, reactive, adaptive or proactive. A system can also be built with or without the power to rewire its own connections, depending on how much stakeholders are willing to let it decide."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000006","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Autonomy as a dial"}
{"body":{"matters":"how mismatched meaning gets bridged","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000008"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000009"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000A"}],"prose":"Parts that speak differently are joined by translation and by short-lived agreements, not by one standard everyone adopts. The rest of the body depends on this."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000007","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning shared without a common tongue"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much each party must give up","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"}],"prose":"What separates systems is sorted into kinds and concerns. Three ways of joining are set side by side: everyone adopts one format, everyone maps through a common layer, or each pair translates for itself. The third is chosen because it asks no part to change."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000008","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Barriers and three postures"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long an agreement lives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"Meaning is agreed for one task and discarded when the task ends: a temporary semantic contract in place of a lasting dictionary."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000009","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Disposable vocabularies"}
{"body":{"matters":"knowing what exists and how it can link","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"}],"prose":"The connecting holon is made of a reasoning orchestrator, a translator, and a graph of every known element and how they could link, along with parts that find elements and compose and run workflows across them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The broker's machinery"}
{"body":{"matters":"which concern gets its own voice","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000E"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000F"}],"prose":"Concerns usually kept in governance or design reviews are turned into separate actors in the system: one that judges right from wrong, one for fairness, one for the long run, one for understanding context."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Values made into roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision is not allowed to do","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"}],"prose":"Ethical and bias-aware parts sit beside decisions, like auditors. They encode norms and known kinds of distortion so these can be weighed together with the task, and they guard against leaks and unfair retrieval."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Checks on what is decided"}
{"body":{"matters":"time span of consequence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"}],"prose":"Doing a task well is set apart from doing it cheaply. Being well-done is defined as counting effects on the environment, on society, and over time, and nobody yet knows how to measure it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The long horizon against the short"}
{"body":{"matters":"interpretation that comes before judgment","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"}],"prose":"Interpreting context through structured knowledge comes before fair or effective judgment can happen. The understanding part supplies the knowledge of the situation that the other parts lean on."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Understanding as the ground for others"}
{"body":{"matters":"where one role ends and the next begins","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"}],"prose":"The separate roles keep running into one another. The effective role is shown with the same examples as the ethical one, the mediator is also called the vigilant role, and every role feeds or watches another. This suggests they are aspects of one whole more than separate organs."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles that bleed into each other"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the outside asks of the whole","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000N"}],"prose":"The body is tested against two kinds of outside: something sudden that arrives and demands a response, and a place so thin that what is missing has to be found."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How the body meets the world"}
{"body":{"matters":"speed of turning sensing into response","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000M"}],"prose":"A disruption sets the body's parts in motion. Some notice it, the connections are rewired while the system keeps running, and competing priorities are settled on the spot."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"When the unforeseen arrives"}
{"body":{"matters":"how widely awareness is shared","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"}],"prose":"Awareness is spread across levels so that parts informed only about their own surroundings do not drift away from the whole. Watchers notice the disaster, the accident, the delay."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Sensing the whole"}
{"body":{"matters":"adapting without stopping","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"}],"prose":"Roles, data sources and workflows are reconfigured without a restart. A new participant can join, be understood and be put to work at runtime."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Rewiring while running"}
{"body":{"matters":"which value yields to which","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"}],"prose":"Safety and speed, ethics and efficiency, pull against each other. A higher part arbitrates between them, and in a crisis each domain gives way to a different value."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Rival goods settled in the moment"}
{"body":{"matters":"density of service across a territory","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000Q"}],"prose":"The countryside, with few people and few buses, is where the body is cast. In that place, one of its tasks is to make absence visible."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A sparse place as the proving ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"what absence looks like","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"}],"prose":"Besides routing journeys, the system maps the places people avoid because nothing reaches them. It turns missing service into something it can report."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Finding what is missing"}
{"body":{"matters":"which role takes which post","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Each abstract role takes a concrete post. The traveler interprets, the transport service weighs, the infrastructure watches, the communicator translates, and the mediator directs, all from one trip request to the route that comes back."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles cast into a journey"}
{"body":{"matters":"self-examination","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000Y"}],"prose":"The whole checks itself by building copies of itself, by tracing where it came from, and by naming what it has not yet done."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How the body knows itself"}
{"body":{"matters":"how closely the double matches the actor","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000W"}],"prose":"Here simulation is no longer a model built from outside. The parts act in it as themselves, and they can steer the run they are part of."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Simulation by its own doubles"}
{"body":{"matters":"who directs the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"}],"prose":"This kind of simulation descends from agent-based simulation, where simple local rules produce large patterns. Adding levels of nesting lets the simulated entities direct the run as well as live inside it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"From agents to steering holons"}
{"body":{"matters":"keeping copies and real parts in sync","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Each holon has a copy that plugs into a shared runtime infrastructure. A manager with limited authority synchronizes the copies, and they stay connected to the live parts so they can draw on real data."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Federates as twins"}
{"body":{"matters":"where a discrepancy is caught and reported","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"When a result disagrees with normal operation, the part where it happened flags it, the result is thrown out, and word passes up to the superholon, which may start the run again."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Error travels upward"}
{"body":{"matters":"breadth of domains reached","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"The idea started as a philosophical notion and was taken up on the factory floor. From there it spread to energy grids, construction and cyber-physical systems, carrying the same promise of local autonomy with coordination."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A lineage widening outward"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much remains unbuilt","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Every part comes with its own list of what is still unsolved: standards, scale, privacy, measurement, ontologies still to be built. The whole is presented as a frame for thinking, and its worked case is offered as an illustration, not as proof."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The edges left open"}
{"body":{"matters":"the yardsticks chosen","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"The rural body is judged by time saved, emissions, access and fairness, and praised for growing and bending. It is judged by these measures, not yet by any field result."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What the case is held to"}
{"body":{"matters":"the balance between a part's self-keeping and its being directed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000012"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000020"}],"prose":"Everything in this space circles one balance: how much of itself a part may keep while something larger coordinates it. The answer is given as distribution of authority, yet a single highest holder keeps coming back, and the text itself shows the strain of holding so many pieces together."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000011","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Keeping oneself while being held"}
{"body":{"matters":"where decision lives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000013"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000016"}],"prose":"Before anything is built, the space settles what kind of thing a holon is and where order in a system of them comes from."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000012","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What a part is and who decides"}
{"body":{"matters":"the double standing of each part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000014"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000015"}],"prose":"A holon is defined by being simultaneously self-standing and contained, which separates it from a free agent and gives it a place in a nested order."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000013","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The part that is also a whole"}
{"body":{"matters":"constraint by position","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"}],"prose":"Holons are set beside agents and kept apart from them by rank: an agent roams a flat field, a holon answers to the level above."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000014","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Not quite an agent"}
{"body":{"matters":"the breadth of domains reached","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"The idea travels from a philosopher's coinage to manufacturing cells, then to grids, buildings and data pipelines, gaining generality as it moves."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000015","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A lineage leaving the factory"}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction order flows","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000017"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000018"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000019"}],"prose":"Order is described two ways at once: rising from many small interactions, and handed down by a top with the most authority; the space never fully chooses."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000016","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Where order comes from"}
{"body":{"matters":"emergence without a controller","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"}],"prose":"Simple individual rules yielding large patterns, and coordination emerging without a centre, are the inheritance the proposal claims."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000017","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Order rising from below"}
{"body":{"matters":"autonomy preserved under cooperation","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"}],"prose":"Repeatedly the federation is said to work with no central control and no imposed structure on its members."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000018","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The promise of no centre"}
{"body":{"matters":"who holds final say","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"}],"prose":"The binder is named superholon, orchestrator, highest authority; it restructures workflows and others defer to it, so the pyramid reappears inside the federation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000019","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Authority returning at the top"}
{"body":{"matters":"what crosses a boundary between parts","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001M"}],"prose":"Once parts are allowed to differ, three things have to cross between them: meaning, judgement split into roles, and a binding apparatus that carries both."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What must pass between parts"}
{"body":{"matters":"how meaning survives a crossing","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001E"}],"prose":"Parts built by different hands speak differently; the space treats bridging their meaning as the core difficulty."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning across difference"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much sameness is demanded","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"}],"prose":"Incompatibilities are sorted by kind and concern, and the ways across range from one shared format to none at all."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Barriers and three ways across"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of an agreement","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"Instead of a lasting shared vocabulary, small vocabularies are made for a task, used, and discarded, so agreement is temporary and situated."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning made to expire"}
{"body":{"matters":"reliance on encoded knowledge","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Ethics, understanding, bias and translation are each to be handled by writing down a structured vocabulary, which makes vocabulary-building the recurring unpaid cost."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Ontology as the answer to everything"}
{"body":{"matters":"which aspect of a decision a role guards","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001K"}],"prose":"What a single conscientious decider would do is split among specialised parts, each guarding one aspect of a good decision."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Judgement divided into roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision is not allowed to be","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"}],"prose":"Two roles act as brakes: one checks right and wrong, the other checks unfair leaning, each by rules and audits wrapped around the act."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Restraints on a decision"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far ahead consequences are counted","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"Doing a thing quickly is set against doing it with its later consequences counted, and the hard part is measuring the later."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The horizon of a goal"}
{"body":{"matters":"the reach of what a part perceives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Two roles face outward: one interprets data into a picture, the other watches across levels so that parts informed of their own corner stay aligned with the whole."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Seeing the situation"}
{"body":{"matters":"the flow between roles","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"}],"prose":"The roles are not independent: checks feed the balancer, interpretation feeds both, and the watcher sits over all, so negotiation between them is needed."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles feeding one another"}
{"body":{"matters":"how a binder is built","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001Q"}],"prose":"The thing that holds the parts together is itself a composite, with organs for reasoning, recording, finding, translating, planning and executing."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The binding apparatus"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is trusted to reason","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"}],"prose":"The deciding and translating organs are given to a large language model, trusted for rational choice and for adapting to unseen inputs."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A reasoner at the centre"}
{"body":{"matters":"the record of possible connections","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"}],"prose":"Every new element is recorded in a graph of capabilities and links, which is then searched to assemble a path from request to answer."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A map of what can connect to what"}
{"body":{"matters":"the dial of granted autonomy","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"}],"prose":"Its autonomy is adjustable: remove the planning and executing organs and it only governs, it no longer connects."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How much the binder may act"}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between enacting and showing","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001V"}],"prose":"The proposal is tested not by measurement but by enactment: a simulation that may steer itself, and a countryside cast as a stage."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How the whole is tried"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether participants direct their own trial","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"}],"prose":"An inherited taxonomy of agents and simulation is carried over to holons, adding the claim that participants may direct the very run they are in."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A simulation that directs itself"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much a participant shapes the process","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"}],"prose":"Holons in simulation are ranked by how much they act on the run itself, from mere source of data to rewriting the rules."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Steering by degrees"}
{"body":{"matters":"how the general is cast into the particular","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200001Z"}],"prose":"The rural case gives the architecture actors and a purpose, and is itself split between finding absence, casting roles, mirroring them in simulation, and stating what follows."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A countryside as stage"}
{"body":{"matters":"the visibility of absence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The most distinctive aim is to locate places without transport, so the system's watching is turned toward gaps rather than flows."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Finding where nothing runs"}
{"body":{"matters":"which actor carries which role","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Travellers, transport services, infrastructure and communication each take on one of the abstract roles, and the binder opens and closes the sequence."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles cast as actors"}
{"body":{"matters":"the fidelity between rehearsal and system","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"The simulation duplicates each acting holon as a federate under a manager that is itself a subordinate copy of the binder, so the test is a mirror of the system it tests."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A twin rehearsal"}
{"body":{"matters":"the gap between claim and evidence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Scalability, fairness and lower emissions are stated as results, while the close concedes there is no empirical validation yet."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200001Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Benefit asserted, proof deferred"}
{"body":{"matters":"the integrity of the held text itself","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"}],"prose":"The held text carries its own strain: one role's examples copied verbatim under another, two barrier labels swapped, bullets broken off mid-sentence, a phrase repeated."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000020","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The seams of the text"}
{"body":{"matters":"the price of coherence, paid in sameness","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000023"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000026"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"}],"prose":"Many self-governing parts are asked to act as one, and the paper tries this again and again: through shared meaning, through values given bodies, through a coordinator, and through rehearsal. Each attempt pays for coherence with some loss of each part's own shape, and pays differently."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000022","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Holding together without making alike"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether joining demands structural change","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000024"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000025"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"}],"prose":"The starting lack is wholes that cannot work with other wholes unless someone changes their structure. The idea of the nested part arrives with a history and with a list of what lone autonomy fails at."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000023","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A gap where joining means rebuilding"}
{"body":{"matters":"which ground the idea has been carried into","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"From a philosopher's double-faced entity to factory cells, power grids, building sites and data pipelines, the same figure of part-and-whole keeps being moved into new ground."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000024","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The nested part travels"}
{"body":{"matters":"which shortfall is being named","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Systems that decide by themselves break when conditions shift, inherit skewed judgement, cannot answer for harm, and see too little of their surroundings; twins and learning are offered as the missing feed."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000025","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What autonomy alone gets wrong"}
{"body":{"matters":"which plane carries the binding","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000027"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002G"}],"prose":"Coherence is sought on three planes at once: what things mean between parts, what a decision must respect, and who has the last word. The planes lean on each other."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000026","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Three planes of holding together"}
{"body":{"matters":"where agreement about meaning lives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000028"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000029"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002A"}],"prose":"Agreement on what data means can be imposed from a shared model or worked out at the moment two parts meet; the paper sides with the second and gives parts an interior able to interpret."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000027","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning made between, not above"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much representation must be shared","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"Everyone adopts one format, everyone maps to a common layer, or each pair translates as needed with nothing shared; the last keeps parts free but asks most of the moment of contact."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000028","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Three ways to agree"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a semantic contract lives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"A vocabulary built for one exchange, one episode, one task phase, then dropped or revised; a contract of sense with a lifetime."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000029","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning that expires"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a part can read what reaches it","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"Some parts are given ontologies and reasoning so they can turn mixed, noisy input into a picture of the situation before deciding."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A part that can interpret"}
{"body":{"matters":"which quality is given a body of its own","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002E"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002F"}],"prose":"Fairness, ethics, a long view and watchfulness are not left as properties of the whole; each becomes a kind of part with its own job, and the parts feed one another."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Values given bodies"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision must not violate","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased parts stand beside decisions as checks, encoding rules, harm limits and known patterns of skew, and auditing outcomes in loans, hiring, vehicles and triage."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Guards on a decision"}
{"body":{"matters":"the time horizon a goal is judged over","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"Getting a goal done cheaply is set against getting it done well over time; the difference is carried by weighing many criteria and by measures that are still to be invented."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The longer horizon"}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment of local knowledge with global state","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Parts that know their own corner can still be wrong together; watchful parts spread awareness of the whole state across levels so local choices line up."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Shared watchfulness"}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow between kinds of part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"}],"prose":"The value-bearing parts form a small economy: guards pass verdicts to the long-view part, interpreters supply context, watchers span every level, and conflicts among them go up to be negotiated."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How the organs feed one another"}
{"body":{"matters":"where the final say actually sits","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002N"}],"prose":"A dedicated part binds the rest while promising to leave their insides alone; yet the same part is named the top with the highest say, and its watchers are called orchestrators."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The coordinator that says it does not rule"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of each part's inside stays untouched","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006T6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Joining is negotiated at runtime so each part keeps its own logic, models and scope; the coordinator works at the level of meaning and organisation and leaves the wires to others."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Federation as untouched interiors"}
{"body":{"matters":"which function is handed to which component","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"The binding part is itself a small whole: a deciding orchestrator, a graph of what can connect to what, a translator, a finder, a planner of workflows and their runner, with language models suggested for the first and third."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The coordinator's own organs"}
{"body":{"matters":"rank within the nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"}],"prose":"Despite distributed authority, rank reappears: the top sets directives, the coordinator is superholon with the highest say, and the simulation's manager answers upward to it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The pyramid returns"}
{"body":{"matters":"cost of mediation as parts multiply","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"}],"prose":"Translating and reasoning at every meeting slows with numbers, needs agreed protocols nobody yet has, and carries sensitive traffic that must be guarded and recorded."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What mediation costs as it grows"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether order is designed or arises","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Alongside the designed top runs the older thought that whole-scale order can arise from local interaction with no one in charge."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Pattern from below"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the simulated also directs","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002S"}],"prose":"Simulation is turned around: the parts being simulated also steer the run, and the live system is mirrored in a federation of stand-ins that check its answers."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Parts that rehearse themselves"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is inherited from the agent tradition","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"}],"prose":"The ways agents are simulated, help simulation and watch over it are carried over wholesale to holons, which add nesting to agents' autonomy."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Inherited from agents"}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of influence over the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"From parts that only supply data, through ones that react and learn, to ones that rewrite the run's rules and goals."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Grades of steering"}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between a stand-in and its holon","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Each holon gets a federate twin on a shared runtime; a manager twin answers to the coordinator, discrepancies are flagged upward and invalidate results, and time management keeps the doubles in step."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The federation's double"}
{"body":{"matters":"who is left without a way to move","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002X"}],"prose":"Everything above is cast onto sparse rural transport, where the thing to be found is often an absence."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"One countryside as the trying ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"locating gaps rather than serving demand","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"}],"prose":"Beyond routing trips, the system is asked to locate places with no means of travel, by noticing where requests fail and which zones people avoid."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Finding absence"}
{"body":{"matters":"which dimension each actor wears","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Concrete actors put on the abstract dimensions: travellers as interpreters, transport services as fair and far-sighted, infrastructure as watchers, a communication part as translator, the coordinator as orchestrator."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Casting the roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"the claimed standing of the evidence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"The case is offered as an illustration of fit, with no measurement yet, and the whole framework is called a set of analytical roles rather than an implementation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Showing rather than proving"}
{"body":{"matters":"where the written form departs from its own claims","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"}],"prose":"In a few places the written form slips: the long-view section repeats the ethics examples word for word, two barrier descriptions trade places, and a bullet strays into another section or stands empty."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Where the text folds on itself"}
{"body":{"matters":"what each part is missing, and who covers it","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000031"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003R"}],"prose":"The paper builds a system in which every part is defined by something it cannot do alone, and another part is made to cover it. Even the part that binds the rest is described as wanting a guide. The whole is then rehearsed in simulation and set down on a countryside where the lack is literal: places with no way to travel."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000030","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A whole made of supplied lacks"}
{"body":{"matters":"the match between a shortfall and its remedy","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000032"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000037"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003E"}],"prose":"Read as a ledger, the framework lists shortfalls of autonomous systems, then gives each one a specialised holon, then adds a binding holon because the specialists cannot coordinate themselves."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000031","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The economy of lack"}
{"body":{"matters":"which incapacity is being named","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000033"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000034"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000035"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000036"}],"prose":"Four kinds of missing capacity are named for autonomous systems: they break when conditions shift, they carry bias, they have no account of responsibility, and they see only their own corner."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000032","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The shortfalls named"}
{"body":{"matters":"change at runtime","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"}],"prose":"Fixed models and fixed interfaces do not survive heterogeneous systems meeting at runtime."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000033","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Brittle under change"}
{"body":{"matters":"fairness and accountability","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"}],"prose":"Decisions inherit bias from data and design, and nothing in them reasons about harm or blame."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000034","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Without conscience"}
{"body":{"matters":"shared context","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"}],"prose":"A part may interpret its own data well and still be misaligned with the collective it serves."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000035","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Locally informed, globally blind"}
{"body":{"matters":"time horizon of a goal","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"}],"prose":"Optimising for speed and resource use overlooks longer consequences."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000036","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The short horizon"}
{"body":{"matters":"the mechanism each remedy relies on","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000038"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000039"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003D"}],"prose":"Each shortfall gets a holon kind, each with a mechanism, two example domains and a pair of open problems. Together they are meant to check and feed one another."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000037","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Remedies cast as holons"}
{"body":{"matters":"who defines the rules","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"}],"prose":"Ethics is written down as ontologies and rules and weighed against operational aims; deciding which guidelines to write is left as the hard part."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000038","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Encoded morals"}
{"body":{"matters":"a metric for consequences","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"Effectiveness is multi-criteria utility over time, but how to measure it remains open."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000039","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Weighing the longer term"}
{"body":{"matters":"the quality of the ontology","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"Ontologies and semantic reasoning turn heterogeneous inputs into situational knowledge, at the price of building and maintaining those ontologies."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Making sense of mixed data"}
{"body":{"matters":"detecting bias as it happens","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"}],"prose":"Catalogues of known bias patterns, fairness constraints and audits are folded into decision loops, borrowing the logic of fault detection."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Catching bias"}
{"body":{"matters":"awareness that crosses levels","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Distributed sensing and awareness models spread what is happening across levels, so local acts can be checked against the whole."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Shared watchfulness"}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow between remedies","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased holons pass judgements to effective ones, understanding feeds both, and vigilance watches every layer."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The remedies feed each other"}
{"body":{"matters":"connecting without imposing a common form","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003M"}],"prose":"Because the specialists cannot align themselves, a federated interoperability holon is added to connect them without a common model. It is itself a holon, staffed by the very kinds it coordinates."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The binder that is also bound"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much uniformity is imposed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"Of three ways to make systems talk, one standard format and one shared layer both bind every part; only federation lets each keep its own form."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Why no common language"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"Instead of one lasting ontology, small ones are made for a task, used and dropped, so newcomers can be understood at runtime."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning made for the occasion"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the binder borrows from its parts","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"}],"prose":"The binder lacks its own sense of when to act, so it takes the other kinds into itself: unbiased holons for retrieval, ethical ones as validation, vigilant ones as orchestrators."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Staffed by the specialists"}
{"body":{"matters":"which component carries the autonomy","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"Six components, with a language model at the head, a capability graph of known elements, and workflows generated and run; dropping the last two leaves it only able to steer, not to connect."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Anatomy of the binder"}
{"body":{"matters":"the boundary of the contribution","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"It takes on meaning and organisation and leaves technical plumbing assumed, calling itself a coordination above holons rather than their replacement."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What the binder claims and declines"}
{"body":{"matters":"the price of scale","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"}],"prose":"Standards that require consensus, load that grows with every holon, and sensitive exchanges that must be secured."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What binding costs"}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority settles","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003Q"}],"prose":"Autonomy is praised throughout, yet authority keeps collecting at the top. The inherited idea of a holon and the paper's own architecture both lean toward a pyramid with a highest authority."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The shape of command"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the idea carries in from its past","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"}],"prose":"From Koestler through manufacturing to grids and construction, the holon arrives already carrying a hierarchy in which higher levels direct lower ones within bounded freedom."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"An inheritance of nested authority"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much freedom the top leaves below","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Holons keep local discretion, yet in the built system one holon holds the highest authority and may restructure the rest."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Autonomy held under a summit"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the claim reaches beyond its evidence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000041"}],"prose":"The construction is tested three ways: by letting it direct its own rehearsal, by casting it onto rural transport, and, unintentionally, by the seams in the text that show what is still unfinished."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Trying the whole"}
{"body":{"matters":"who steers the simulation","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003W"}],"prose":"Simulation is not only a place where holons are modelled; holons may steer how the simulation runs, and the deployed system can be mirrored into an HLA federation that checks it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A system that directs its own rehearsal"}
{"body":{"matters":"what holons add to agents","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"}],"prose":"The categories of agent-directed simulation are carried over to holons, adding nested levels to emergent behaviour."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"From agents to holons"}
{"body":{"matters":"depth of intervention in the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"}],"prose":"Holons may only supply data, or react, or learn, or rewrite the rules and objectives of the run."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Degrees of steering"}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between system and twin","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Each holon gets a federate twin, a reduced copy of the binder manages the run, and faults are flagged upward and end in a scored analysis."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The federation as mirror"}
{"body":{"matters":"absence of service as a place on a map","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200003Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000040"}],"prose":"The framework lands where lack is literal: sparse places, costly services, and areas with no transport at all, which the system is meant to find as well as serve."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Rural ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"finding where nothing runs","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Beyond routing trips, the platform locates areas no transport reaches, reported upward by watching and understanding holons."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Deserts as gaps to be found"}
{"body":{"matters":"which kind each actor plays","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Travellers, transport services, infrastructure and communication each become one or more of the proposed kinds, all synchronised by the binder."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200003Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles cast onto actors"}
{"body":{"matters":"the benefit asserted","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"Scalability, responsiveness, equitable access and lower emissions are claimed for the scheme."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000040","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Goods promised for the case"}
{"body":{"matters":"the gap between the construction and its evidence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000042"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000043"}],"prose":"The writing shows its own unfinished state: copied examples, stray fragments, swapped definitions, and a closing that names the work conceptual and unvalidated."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000041","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Seams in the text"}
{"body":{"matters":"integrity of the text itself","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"}],"prose":"The effective holon's examples repeat the ethical ones word for word; some paragraphs are fragments cut by layout; the definitions of organisational and technology barriers appear exchanged."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000042","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Copied and stray"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is asserted versus shown","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"The roles are offered as analytical constructs; the case study is said not to validate them, and empirical work is deferred."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000043","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Held as concept, tested later"}
{"body":{"matters":"where the final say comes to rest","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000046"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000052"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000053"}],"prose":"The held space describes a society of parts that is said to need no centre, and then, wherever the parts must agree, places something above them with the last word. Everything else in it, faculties, meaning, simulation, the rural ground, is arranged around that rising seat of authority."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000045","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A headless whole that grows a head"}
{"body":{"matters":"how difference among parts is held together","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000047"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004N"}],"prose":"How the parts are given distinct faculties, how they come to disagree, how something settles their disagreements, and the shared speech that makes settling possible."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000046","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The working society of parts"}
{"body":{"matters":"which faculty a part carries","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000048"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000049"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004B"}],"prose":"Capacities a single agent would hold together, judging, seeing, foreseeing, are separated and handed to different kinds of part, which then must feed one another."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000047","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Faculties dealt out to parts"}
{"body":{"matters":"what counts as a fair or right decision","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"}],"prose":"One part keeps to rules of right and wrong, another checks for skew; both appear later as validation layers that inspect what others produce."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000048","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Faculties of judgment"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of the situation is seen, and by whom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"One part turns scattered data into a grasp of the situation, another keeps that grasp shared across levels so local choices do not drift from the whole."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000049","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Faculties of perception"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far ahead consequences are counted","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"The effective part differs from the efficient one only in how far ahead and how widely it counts consequences, which makes it hard to measure."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Effectiveness as a longer horizon"}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow between faculties","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"The faculties are wired in a flow: judgment and perception feed the effective part, and the watcher spans every layer."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Faculties feeding one another"}
{"body":{"matters":"which aim yields when aims collide","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004E"}],"prose":"Once parts carry different values, safety against speed, fairness against yield, their aims collide, and the collision is resolved one level up rather than among peers."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Disagreement needs a mediator"}
{"body":{"matters":"the trade between harm and haste","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"}],"prose":"The recurring friction is between doing right and doing fast; it is named as a challenge for the ethical part, for the effective part, and again when the two must be reconciled."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Conscience against speed"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the arbiter may and may not touch","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"}],"prose":"Conflicts are settled by fixed priorities or by adaptive strategies, always without reaching inside a part's own logic, only by steering what it receives and when it acts."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Arbitration by rule or by learning"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much power the top part holds","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004M"}],"prose":"The interoperability holon begins as a connector and ends as the superholon with the highest authority, its core a language model choosing and composing workflows."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The seat that appears at the top"}
{"body":{"matters":"the autonomy each part is promised","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"}],"prose":"Again and again the text promises coordination without central control, autonomy kept, federation instead of integration."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The vow of no centre"}
{"body":{"matters":"the rank actually written in","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"}],"prose":"Alongside the vow stand plain statements of rank: top holons hold most authority, a guide is needed to synchronise the merely efficient, and in the case study one holon outranks all."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Authority admitted"}
{"body":{"matters":"the setting of the autonomy dial","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"}],"prose":"How far the top may reach is left adjustable: parts are not necessarily fully autonomous, and the workflow builders can be removed so the top only watches execution."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Autonomy as a dial"}
{"body":{"matters":"what kind of mind sits in the seat","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"}],"prose":"The deciding and translating components are proposed as language models, chosen for their reasoning and for adapting to unfamiliar inputs; around them a graph of capabilities lets elements be found and chained."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A language model in the chair"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether watching is also ruling","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"}],"prose":"The part meant to keep shared awareness turns out to be the one that oversees all others; vigilance and command are named as the same role."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Watcher and conductor become one"}
{"body":{"matters":"how meaning crosses a boundary","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004R"}],"prose":"Parts can only be steered if their words can be carried across; most of the machinery is about making meaning travel between vocabularies that were never agreed."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning as the medium of coordination"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"}],"prose":"Instead of one lasting vocabulary, small temporary ones are built at runtime for a task, used, and discarded, so that a newcomer can be understood without prior agreement."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meanings made for the moment"}
{"body":{"matters":"which wall is being crossed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"}],"prose":"Incompatibilities are sorted into conceptual, organisational and technical walls across data, service, process and business, and three ways through are compared, of which only federation leaves each side its own form."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Kinds of wall and ways through"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a faculty is made of","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"}],"prose":"Ethics, understanding and fairness are each to be built from formal vocabularies: of norms, of domains, of known biases. The faculties are distinct but rest on one substrate."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Ontology underneath every faculty"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the reflection keeps the shape of what it reflects","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004Y"}],"prose":"The society of parts is shown twice over: once in a simulation of itself, once laid onto country roads. In both the same rank reappears."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The whole seen in its mirrors"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the modelled control the model","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004X"}],"prose":"The parts are not only modelled; they are allowed to direct the model they are in, and the simulation becomes a subordinate copy of the system that reports upward."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Simulation that the simulated steer"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is inherited and what is added","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Agent-directed simulation and its emergence stories are inherited, with structure and levels added, to coin a new term."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"From agents to holons in simulation"}
{"body":{"matters":"the degree to which a part rewrites the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"}],"prose":"Parts range from mere data sources to ones that rewrite the rules and objectives of the run."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Degrees of steering"}
{"body":{"matters":"how errors travel upward","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"}],"prose":"Each part gets a federate twin; a manager twin with authority bounded to the run sits under the top part, errors are flagged and passed up, and the run ends in scoring and possible restart."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The federated mirror"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether absence becomes visible","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000050"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000051"}],"prose":"The framework is cast onto sparse country transport, where the aim is both routing travellers and seeing where no transport exists at all."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The rural ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"what gaps are detected","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"}],"prose":"Beyond optimising trips, the system is meant to map transit deserts, places noticed by the routes people avoid."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Seeing the absence"}
{"body":{"matters":"which faculty each actor is given","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"}],"prose":"Travellers become understanding parts, services become fair and effective parts, infrastructure becomes watchers, all brought up and synchronised by the top part."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000050","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles cast onto travellers and roads"}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between claim and evidence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"}],"prose":"Benefits of scale, fairness and lower emissions are asserted, while the closing admits the case is illustration, not validation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000051","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Promise held without proof"}
{"body":{"matters":"which failure is being answered","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"}],"prose":"Inheritance from manufacturing and grids, plus the known failings of autonomous systems, biased, brittle, unaccountable, set the stage for parts that carry conscience and awareness."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000052","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Why the parts need minding now"}
{"body":{"matters":"the text's fidelity to itself","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"}],"prose":"The space has visible stitches: the effective holon's examples repeat the ethical holon's word for word, two barrier definitions appear swapped, and stray bullets and fragments sit out of place."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000053","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Seams in the held text"}
{"body":{"matters":"where coherence is produced when no part yields","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000056"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005E"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000063"}],"prose":"The held space is about many parts that will not give up their own vocabulary, rules or owners, yet must behave as one whole. Everything in it is an answer to where that oneness gets made: in a go-between, in a division of judgment into roles, in a rehearsal, and in a sparse place where the work is tried."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000055","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Acting as one without merging"}
{"body":{"matters":"what each part keeps for itself","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000057"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000058"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000059"}],"prose":"The ground beneath everything is a decision not to fuse the parts. Sharing a single format or a common layer is turned down because it would cost each part its freedom to change on its own."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000056","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The refusal to merge"}
{"body":{"matters":"the bound on a part's freedom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"A part is whole in itself and also answers to something larger; its freedom is real but bounded by its place. This double standing is taken as given, and every later design must leave it intact."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000057","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Autonomy as a premise"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is held in common","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"}],"prose":"Systems can meet by all adopting one form, by mapping through a shared middle model, or by translating pairwise with nothing held in common. The third is chosen, and the obstacles it must cross are sorted by kind and by concern."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000058","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Three ways of meeting"}
{"body":{"matters":"which layer is allowed to be uniform","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"}],"prose":"Having refused a uniform standard, the text keeps calling for shared protocols, formats and agreed ontological patterns. The thing declined at the level of meaning comes back at the level of wire and governance."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000059","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The standard that returns"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a shared meaning lives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005D"}],"prose":"Instead of a lasting common vocabulary, meaning is negotiated each time two parts meet and dropped when the meeting ends. Agreement becomes an event, not a possession."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning made at the meeting"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime and scope of a semantic agreement","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"Small ontologies are built for one task or episode, used, then discarded or revised. They let a newcomer be understood at runtime without anyone having agreed in advance."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Temporary contracts of sense"}
{"body":{"matters":"who carries the cost of difference","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"}],"prose":"Someone must render one part's inputs into another's terms, across syntax and meaning alike. That labour is given to a dedicated component, and a language model is named as the likely translator."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Translation as a standing job"}
{"body":{"matters":"the absence of a single authority under sudden load","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006T6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"}],"prose":"The pressure for runtime agreement is shown in crowded settings where transport, energy and care belong to different hands and no sovereign exists. An accident or disruption forces them to coordinate at once."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Many owners, one emergency"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much authority the mediator holds","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005J"}],"prose":"A special holon is placed among the others to bind them, and it gradually becomes the one above them. Its anatomy, its duties and the degree of its power are the substance here."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The go-between that rises"}
{"body":{"matters":"which pieces the mediator is made of","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"}],"prose":"The mediator is built from six pieces: a deciding head, a recorder of what exists and how it can connect, a translator, a finder, and a planner and runner of workflows. The record of possible links is what lets new elements be wired in."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Anatomy of the binder"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the mediator is responsible for","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"It brokers communication, steers conflicting goals toward convergence, gathers data for those who decide, arbitrates disputes and reshapes roles as conditions change. It works on meaning and organisation, leaving the technical plumbing assumed."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Duties of the binder"}
{"body":{"matters":"the drift from mediation to command","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Presented first as a connector that respects autonomy, the mediator becomes the orchestrator, the superholon, and finally the holder of highest authority that can restructure everything below it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"From connector to highest authority"}
{"body":{"matters":"the setting of the autonomy dial","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005K"}],"prose":"How far the mediator and its holons may act is left adjustable: workflow planning can be removed, leaving only control of execution, and holons in simulation range from passive sources to rule-changing actors."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A dial of autonomy"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far a holon may alter the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"}],"prose":"Holons in simulation may only supply data, react, learn across runs, or rewrite the rules and objectives; the ladder is one of increasing reach over the run itself."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Degrees of steering"}
{"body":{"matters":"which faculty is separated out and what it guards","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005V"}],"prose":"A single good decision is split into separate faculties, each given its own holon: weighing the long term, grasping context, checking for bias, keeping to norms, and staying aware. The whole then depends on how these roles feed and watch one another."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Judgment divided into roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"the deficit each role is meant to fill","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Each role answers a named failing of autonomous systems: brittleness when conditions shift, inherited bias, missing accountability, and thin awareness. The hope is that adding data, learning and ethics to a holarchy closes these gaps."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The deficits that call for roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"the quality of the shared picture","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"}],"prose":"Before any role can judge, something must turn raw heterogeneous data into situational knowledge and spread a shared picture across levels. Understanding and vigilance are the faculties the others stand on."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Sense and awareness as substrate"}
{"body":{"matters":"who evaluates whom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005T"}],"prose":"Some roles do not decide but check what others decide; one role watches all layers. The arrangement is a small polity of evaluation feeding a balancer, under a monitor."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Checkers, deciders and an overseer"}
{"body":{"matters":"the verdict passed upward","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"}],"prose":"Norm-keeping and bias-checking holons pass their verdicts to the holon that trades short-term gain against long-term outcome; inside the mediator they become validation layers and guarded stores."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Checks that feed a decision"}
{"body":{"matters":"the time horizon of a goal","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"}],"prose":"The effective role refuses mere speed and asks for long consequences, but how to measure that remains open, with scores, votes or rules offered as candidates."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The weigher of horizons"}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment of local choice with the whole","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"}],"prose":"The vigilant role watches outputs below it and system-wide states, keeping local choices aligned with the whole; it is also what the orchestrators are said to be."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The overseer of all layers"}
{"body":{"matters":"how distinct a role stays when used","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"}],"prose":"The roles are crisp in name but blur in use: the effective role borrows the ethical role's examples word for word, and in the trial a communicating holon is called unbiased and a traveller's holon called understanding. In the end they are named analytical constructs rather than parts to be built."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Porous boundaries between roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between rehearsal and act","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200005Y"}],"prose":"Simulation is not only where holons are modelled but where they take the wheel, and the trial system is doubled by a simulated twin that tests and can veto its results."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Rehearsal that steers itself"}
{"body":{"matters":"what holons add over flat agents","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Agent simulation, assisted simulation and monitored simulation are carried over to holons, with the added layering that lets them coordinate across levels. Emergent social patterns from simple local rules stand behind the move."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"From agents to holons in simulation"}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between the twin and the live system","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Each live holon has a federate copy, synchronised through a shared runtime and managed by a local stand-in for the mediator. Discrepancies are flagged upward, results invalidated, and outcomes scored on time, emissions and access."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A twin that can veto"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is missing and how it comes to be seen","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000060"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000061"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000062"}],"prose":"The ideas are tried where people and services are thin on the ground, so that a key object is not a flow to optimise but an absence to locate."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200005Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A sparse place as the trial ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"the detectability of a gap","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Places with no transport are found from gaps in routes, from monitoring, and from reports of zones people avoid. Noticing the lack becomes a product in its own right, alongside serving trips."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000060","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Absence made visible"}
{"body":{"matters":"the order in which roles touch a request","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"A request passes from a traveller's holon through service holons, monitored conditions and a translating communicator, is optimised, validated and returned. Every role of the earlier division is given a station along this path."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000061","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The path of a single trip"}
{"body":{"matters":"the gap between claim and evidence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"The trial is said to yield scalability, responsiveness, fairer access and lower emissions, though it is offered as a demonstration rather than a validation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000062","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Goods claimed for the sparse place"}
{"body":{"matters":"breadth behind and debts ahead","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000064"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000065"}],"prose":"Around the core stands where the idea came from and what it has not yet faced: a widening from factories to grids and building sites, and unsolved costs of scale, security and proof."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000063","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Lineage and open edges"}
{"body":{"matters":"breadth of domain reached","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"The whole-and-part idea moved from philosophy into manufacturing, then into energy, construction and cyber-physical systems, each step adding data and learning to the parts."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000064","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Widening from the factory"}
{"body":{"matters":"what remains unproven","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Real-time reasoning may stall at scale, mediated exchanges carry sensitive data, biases and ontologies are hard to build, and there is no empirical test yet."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000065","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Costs not yet paid"}
{"body":{"matters":"where the weight the whole owes is put down","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000068"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000069"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006Z"}],"prose":"The paper sketches a system that owes something to the people it serves and tries to spread that debt across its parts: each part takes on a share, one part binds them, a rehearsal tests them, and a rural road map is where it is meant to land. Much of it is still drawn in intention rather than built."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000067","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A whole that answers for its parts"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the idea has travelled before this paper picks it up","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"The nested-wholes idea arrives from philosophy through factory floors and spreads into grids, construction and twins; the paper inherits that momentum and the hope that adding learning machines makes the parts smarter."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000068","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"An inherited paradigm on the move"}
{"body":{"matters":"which share of the whole's duty each part carries","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006F"}],"prose":"Instead of one mind that must be good, careful and wise at once, each virtue becomes a kind of part with its own job, and the parts lean on one another."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000069","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The burden shared out as roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"rank against local freedom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"}],"prose":"A part's freedom is bounded by where it sits: the higher it stands the more it may decide, yet the lower ones keep a room of their own."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Authority follows position"}
{"body":{"matters":"the shape of the gap each role is cut to fill","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"}],"prose":"Every new kind of part is introduced as the answer to a specific failing of present autonomous systems: harm, short-sightedness, misreading, prejudice, isolation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Each role born from a named lack"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a role judges or senses","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006E"}],"prose":"The five roles divide into those that weigh a decision and those that perceive the world it is made in."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles as checks on deciding"}
{"body":{"matters":"which standard a choice is held against","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"}],"prose":"The ethical, effective and unbiased parts each hold a decision against a standard beyond speed: harm, the long run, fairness to the person being decided about."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Weighing roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of the situation reaches the decider","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"The understanding and vigilant parts make sense of scattered data and keep the whole aware of itself, so that local choices do not drift apart."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Perceiving roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction evaluations flow between roles","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"The roles are not parallel silos: judges hand verdicts to the balancer, the interpreters feed the judges, and the watchers span every level."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles that feed each other"}
{"body":{"matters":"coordination without uniformity","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006P"}],"prose":"One special part is proposed to make the others speak and act together without forcing them into one mould, keeping their inner ways intact."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The binder"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much each participant must surrender to join","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"Of three ways to make systems work together, the paper chooses the one with no shared format and no common layer, because the others ask every part to give up its shape."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Refusing a single standard"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"}],"prose":"Agreement about words is struck at runtime, used for one exchange and discarded, so newcomers can be understood without a dictionary written in advance."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning made for the moment"}
{"body":{"matters":"which organ does what, and which can be removed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"Inside, it is a small machine of six organs: a deciding head, a registry graph of capabilities, a translator, a finder, and a pair that plans and runs workflows, the last two optional."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The binder's anatomy"}
{"body":{"matters":"how conflicts between roles are settled","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"}],"prose":"When the careful part and the efficient part want different things, the binder negotiates, arbitrates and reconfigures, and it is meant to do this across organisational lines."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Mediating aims that pull apart"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the mediator itself puts at risk","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"}],"prose":"A part that carries every exchange becomes the place where standards must be agreed, load piles up and secrets can leak, and traceability is offered as a guard."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The binder's own exposure"}
{"body":{"matters":"where control actually comes to rest","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The design is praised for having no central control, yet the binder ends up as the superholon with the highest authority, its head a language model; the flat promise and the crowned structure sit side by side."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A decentralisation that crowns a top"}
{"body":{"matters":"who directs the trial run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006T"}],"prose":"Simulation is where the parts try the whole out, and the paper wants parts that do not only play in the rehearsal but steer it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Rehearsal before acting"}
{"body":{"matters":"the step from being simulated to directing simulation","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"The lineage runs from agents that are simulated, through agents that assist and monitor simulation, to holons that direct it, with emergence from simple local rules as the inherited intuition."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"From agents to steering wholes"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far a part may change the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"}],"prose":"Steering is graded from parts that merely report, through parts that react and learn, to parts that rewrite the rules and set new goals."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Degrees of steering"}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between the rehearsal and the real","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"The rehearsal mirrors the working system part for part, with its own manager under the binder; errors are flagged upward, results invalidated, and the run ends in a reckoning of time, emissions and access."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A shadow of the live system"}
{"body":{"matters":"making an absence visible","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006Y"}],"prose":"The landing place is sparse countryside, and the most telling aim is not routing but locating the places that transport has abandoned."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Ground: finding where no one can go"}
{"body":{"matters":"detecting what is missing rather than optimising what exists","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Places with no means of travel are to be found from gaps in routes and from zones people avoid, and reported to those who could serve them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Deserts as the thing to see"}
{"body":{"matters":"which concrete actor wears which role","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Each abstract role is given a body: travellers become interpreting parts, services become fair and effective ones, roads and weather become watched ones, and the binder starts and ends every request."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles cast onto travel"}
{"body":{"matters":"claimed outcome against shown outcome","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"The case closes on benefits stated rather than measured: scale, flexibility, fair access, fewer emissions."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Promised goods"}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between what is claimed and what is held up","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000070"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000071"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000072"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200006P"}],"prose":"The text shows where the proposal is still being stitched: copied passages, crossed definitions, conclusions that admit no testing, and a hierarchy that slips back in."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200006Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Seams in the sketch"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether each role has its own evidence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"}],"prose":"The effective role's illustrations are word for word the ethical role's, so the long-run part is shown doing the careful part's work."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000070","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Examples worn twice"}
{"body":{"matters":"consistency of the terms the scope rests on","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"}],"prose":"The organisational and technological barriers are described with each other's meanings, and later the paper leans on that distinction to scope its own contribution."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000071","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Crossed definitions"}
{"body":{"matters":"what remains to be shown","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"The authors call the roles analytical constructs, deny the case is a validation, and name the lack of empirical work as the limit; the choice of a language model as head is argued by plausibility alone."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000072","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Untested by its own account"}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority over meaning and action sits","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000075"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000079"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000081"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000082"}],"prose":"The paper keeps circling one problem: how a whole can act together when its parts keep their own insides, their own vocabularies and their own judgement. Every move it makes, from virtues given bodies to meanings agreed at runtime to a rehearsal in simulation, is a way of binding without absorbing."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000074","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Coordinating parts one does not own"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much a part keeps for itself","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000076"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000077"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000078"}],"prose":"A holon is set apart from an agent by being nested: it answers upward while keeping a bounded freedom. The lineage runs from a philosopher's idea through factory floors into grids and buildings."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000075","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Parts that keep their insides"}
{"body":{"matters":"rank in the nest","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000116"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"}],"prose":"Position in the holarchy decides how far a holon may decide; authority is spread across levels yet still thickens toward the top."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000076","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Nesting sets the reach of freedom"}
{"body":{"matters":"the line that separates the two kinds","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"}],"prose":"Agents act flat and free; holons add organisational awareness across levels, and a holonic agent is the hybrid. Humans in the loop and agentic AI blur the line further."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000077","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Holon set against agent"}
{"body":{"matters":"which domain the idea migrates into next","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"From Koestler to holonic manufacturing to smart grids, construction and data pipelines, the idea spreads wherever control must be decentralised."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000078","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A lineage that keeps widening"}
{"body":{"matters":"which concern earns its own holon","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007E"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007J"}],"prose":"Concerns that autonomous systems handle badly are each handed to a specialised kind of holon, so that ethics, horizon, meaning, fairness and watchfulness become roles rather than properties of one mind."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000079","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Virtues given separate bodies"}
{"body":{"matters":"the shortfall being answered","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"}],"prose":"Brittle adaptation, embedded bias, missing accountability and thin awareness are named first; the roles are cut to fit them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The gaps the roles answer"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision is tested against","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007D"}],"prose":"Two roles stand beside a decision rather than making it: one tests it against norms, the other against known distortions."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Checks laid on a decision"}
{"body":{"matters":"the encoded norm","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"}],"prose":"Ethics is written into ontologies and rule systems and weighed alongside operational goals, with the hard part being which norms and at what cost to speed."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Norms encoded as constraints"}
{"body":{"matters":"detectability of a bias","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"}],"prose":"Bias is treated as patterns that can be catalogued and audited in a loop, borrowing from fault detection."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Distortion caught and corrected"}
{"body":{"matters":"time horizon of the objective","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"Effective holons weigh consequences beyond the goal at hand, which forces a question of how effect is ever measured."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The long horizon against the quick win"}
{"body":{"matters":"the structure that makes data interpretable","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"Understanding holons turn mixed data into situational knowledge through ontologies and inference, at the cost of building and keeping those ontologies."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning built from structure"}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment between local and global","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"}],"prose":"Vigilant holons share awareness so that locally sound choices do not drift out of line with the whole; they become the orchestrators."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Watching across levels"}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow among roles","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"Checks flow into the effective holon, understanding feeds both, and vigilance spans all layers; the roles form a small holarchy of their own."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How the roles feed one another"}
{"body":{"matters":"the recurring scene","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"}],"prose":"Hospitals, disasters, cities and roads recur under nearly every role, so the examples act as shared ground the roles are tried on."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Scenes that travel between roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"when agreement about meaning is struck","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007R"}],"prose":"Rather than forcing one model on all, agreement is negotiated between parties when they meet, and a dedicated holon is built to broker it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning agreed at the meeting point"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much each party must give up","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"One can impose a format, share a meta-model, or translate case by case; only the last leaves each party whole."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Three ways to agree"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"Short-lived ontologies are temporary semantic contracts struck for one exchange and discarded after, so coherence never needs a permanent repository."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Ontologies made to be thrown away"}
{"body":{"matters":"which organ does the binding","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"The federated interoperability holon is given organs: an orchestrator, a graph of what can connect to what, a translator, a finder, and a workflow maker and runner, with language models proposed for the thinking parts."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The broker as a body"}
{"body":{"matters":"which role sits inside the mediator","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"}],"prose":"Inside the broker the five roles reappear as its subholons: fairness for retrieval, ethics as a validation layer, vigilance as orchestration."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The broker absorbs the virtues"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether mediating becomes ruling","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The broker is said to work without central control yet is also named the highest authority; coordination and command lean against each other."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A mediator that sits on top"}
{"body":{"matters":"who steers the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007W"}],"prose":"Simulation is not only a model of the holons but something they steer; the system builds a mirror of itself in which it can be tried and corrected."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The whole rehearses itself"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is carried over from agents","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Holon-directed simulation is derived by analogy from agent-directed simulation and its line of emergent social models."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A taxonomy inherited from agents"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far a holon may alter the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"Holons range from passive sources of data to proactive authors of the simulation's rules."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Degrees of steering"}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between the system and its double","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Each holon gets a federate double under a manager that is itself a subholon of the broker; errors flag upward and invalidate results."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A federate twin of the system"}
{"body":{"matters":"where nothing arrives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200007Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000080"}],"prose":"The sparse countryside becomes the place to try the whole; its most distinctive aim is finding where no transport reaches at all."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Locating absence on the ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"the visibility of gaps","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Beyond routing trips, the system surfaces zones people avoid for lack of options."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Deserts as the thing to find"}
{"body":{"matters":"which role handles which step","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Traveller, transport, infrastructure and communication holons each take one of the five roles, and a request is passed through them to a route."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles cast onto a trip"}
{"body":{"matters":"the promised gain","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"Scalability, flexibility, fairness and lower emissions are named as outcomes of the arrangement."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000080","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Benefits claimed for the ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"distance between concept and evidence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"The authors frame the roles as analytical constructs, not implementations, list open obstacles, and call the case a demonstration rather than a test."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000081","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Held as provisional"}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity of the text to itself","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000083"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000084"}],"prose":"The text as held carries its own fractures: a sentence broken across a heading, examples copied from one role into another, barrier labels crossed, an empty bullet."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000082","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Seams in the held text"}
{"body":{"matters":"continuity of a single thought","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"A list item begun at the end of one section finishes inside another, after two other bullets, so a list of requirements is scattered."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000083","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A sentence split across sections"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a passage belongs where it stands","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"}],"prose":"The effective holon's examples repeat the ethical holon's word for word, and the descriptions of organisational and technological barriers are swapped."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000084","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Content duplicated or crossed"}
{"body":{"matters":"how a part stays itself while acting in a whole","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000087"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008E"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000093"}],"prose":"The held space is about parts that keep their own meaning and their own judgement and must still act as one. It answers twice: meaning is agreed locally and briefly where parts meet, while authority quietly gathers in a single coordinating holon at the top."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000086","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Own sense, one act"}
{"body":{"matters":"where meaning is kept and who shares it","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000088"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000089"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008D"}],"prose":"Under nearly every proposal lies one move: put knowledge into an explicit structure of concepts so a holon can interpret what reaches it. Comprehension is treated as the precondition for every other capability."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000087","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning as the ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"turning data into situational knowledge","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"}],"prose":"A prior dictionary of understanding seeds the whole idea of holons that comprehend, and returns as the understanding holon that fuses scattered data into knowledge of a situation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000088","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The dictionary of understanding"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a value can be written down as structure","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Ethics, fairness and comprehension are all to be realised the same way, as concepts written into an ontology that a decision can be checked against. Different virtues share a single kind of machinery."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000089","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"One mechanism under many virtues"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long an agreement on meaning must last","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008C"}],"prose":"Instead of one lasting shared vocabulary, parts make small temporary vocabularies for a task or an episode and drop them afterwards. Meaning becomes a contract with a lifetime."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Agreements that expire"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a stranger needs to be understood","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"}],"prose":"A newcomer finds, reads and speaks with the others at the moment it joins, with no prior agreement, by building or aligning a vocabulary on the spot."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Discovery at arrival"}
{"body":{"matters":"coexistence of several states of meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"Short-lived ontologies act as temporary semantic contracts, versioned and mapped across states, letting different kinds of holons negotiate priorities without a global ontology."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Contracts of meaning"}
{"body":{"matters":"the amount of common structure imposed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"}],"prose":"Three ways to make systems interoperate differ in what they force everyone to hold in common: one format, one shared layer, or nothing fixed at all. The federated way is chosen because it asks for the least."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How much must be shared"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a quality is a trait or a part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008J"}],"prose":"Ethical, effective, understanding, unbiased and vigilant are not offered as properties of every holon but as kinds of holon, separate parts that carry one quality each for the rest."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Qualities become organs"}
{"body":{"matters":"which deficit each kind is cast against","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"}],"prose":"Every proposed kind of holon is the mirror of one named shortfall of autonomous systems: brittleness, bias, moral blindness, shallow context, poor shared awareness."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Each organ answers a lack"}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction evaluations flow","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"}],"prose":"The kinds pass judgements among themselves: checks of fairness and safety flow to the one that weighs short against long term, comprehension feeds both, and vigilance watches across all levels."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Organs consult each other"}
{"body":{"matters":"the job a quality is assigned when built","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"}],"prose":"Once placed inside the coordinating holon and the mobility system, each quality takes on an operational job: the unbiased one becomes storage and translation of messages, the vigilant one becomes the orchestrator, the understanding one faces the traveller."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Organs recast as jobs"}
{"body":{"matters":"what remains undefined","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Each quality stops at the same wall: its guidelines, its metric, its ontology or its detector has not been defined, and is deferred to future algorithms."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What cannot yet be specified"}
{"body":{"matters":"where a decision finally sits","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008Q"}],"prose":"Holons are said to keep local autonomy without central control, yet the system repeatedly places one holon above the others with the highest authority. The holarchy leans back toward a pyramid at its apex."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Autonomy and the pyramid"}
{"body":{"matters":"scope set by level","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"}],"prose":"A holon is whole and part at once, and its reach is set by where it sits in the nesting; this is what separates it from a free agent."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Constrained by position"}
{"body":{"matters":"who can rearrange the others","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The coordinating holon is the superholon with highest authority, its orchestrator likely a language model that reasons and picks tools, able to restructure workflows and the holons themselves."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The holon that directs"}
{"body":{"matters":"the boundary coordination does not cross","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"}],"prose":"Against that, the coordination is described as never reaching into a holon's internal logic: each keeps its representations and decisions, and coordination happens only between them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Autonomy kept inside"}
{"body":{"matters":"the domains the form has entered","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"The nested form moved from a philosophical idea into manufacturing control and then to grids, construction and cyber-physical systems, each time to escape central control."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Where the form has travelled"}
{"body":{"matters":"the relation between a thing and its copy","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008V"}],"prose":"The system is paired with copies of itself, digital twins of the physical and simulation federates of the holons, and the copies are allowed to steer what they copy."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The system with a double"}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of direction over the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Simulation with agents is carried over to holons and graded by how much the holons steer the run, from passive sources of data to rewriting the rules and goals of the simulation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"From taking part to directing"}
{"body":{"matters":"keeping the copy synchronised and honest","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"In the case, each holon gets a federate version connected back to it, managed by a reduced copy of the coordinating holon; discrepancies are flagged upward and results invalidated."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Federates as twins of holons"}
{"body":{"matters":"freshness of data reaching a holon","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"}],"prose":"Digital twins and learning at the edge supply the continuous data that lets holons decide locally and reconfigure without a central collector."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Live feed from the physical"}
{"body":{"matters":"when a commitment is made","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200008Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"}],"prose":"Almost every commitment is moved from design time to the moment of use: links, vocabularies, workflows and roles are formed when needed and undone when not."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Deciding at runtime"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is discoverable and composable","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"The coordinating holon keeps a graph of every element's capabilities, finds elements in it and composes workflows from them, with generation and execution removable for less autonomy."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A graph of what can be done"}
{"body":{"matters":"the kinds of mediation needed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"}],"prose":"Its work is translating, aligning goals, gathering data, arbitrating conflicts and reshaping roles, all while running."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Five acts of mediation"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is missing in the territory","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000090"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000091"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000092"}],"prose":"The rural mobility case tests the whole on sparse territory, where the most distinctive output is not a route but a located gap: places where no transport reaches."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200008Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Finding absence on the map"}
{"body":{"matters":"gaps between demand and service","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"By gathering requests, routes and avoided zones, the system is meant to reveal areas without means of travel and report them to those who could serve them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000090","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Mobility deserts"}
{"body":{"matters":"the order in which roles act","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"A request passes from the traveller-facing holon through transport and infrastructure holons, via a translating communication holon, to optimised routes returned to the user."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000091","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"One trip through the roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is demonstrated and what is hoped","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Benefits of scale, fairness and lower emissions are claimed, while the closing admits no empirical validation and calls the roles analytical constructs."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000092","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Shown versus proposed"}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity of the text to itself","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"}],"prose":"The reading carries traces of assembly: application examples copied verbatim between two kinds of holon, two barrier definitions exchanged, stray bullets and broken fragments. The text does not always agree with itself."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000093","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The text's own seams"}
{"body":{"matters":"where coherence is made to live","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000096"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000A0"}],"prose":"The held space is about parts that refuse to dissolve into the system and yet must act as one. Its weight moves from the parts, to what passes between them, to whoever arranges the passing, and then it is rehearsed and grounded in a place."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000095","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Wholes that keep themselves and still meet"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a part refuses to give up","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000097"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000098"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000099"}],"prose":"Each part stays whole: it keeps its own model, logic and scope. What it carries is described as kinds of attention it can bring to a shared decision."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000096","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The kept self"}
{"body":{"matters":"level of nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"A part is also a whole at another scale; authority runs down the nest while autonomy stays local. The idea travels from philosophy to factories to grids and sites."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000097","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Nesting as the first shape"}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of local freedom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"}],"prose":"Freedom is graded rather than absolute: a part decides locally within bounds set by its position and the objectives above it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000098","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Autonomy held under constraint"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a part is attending to","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009E"}],"prose":"The five new roles read best as five things a part can be looking at: what is right, how far ahead, what things mean, and what the others are doing."},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000099","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Capacities as kinds of attention"}
{"body":{"matters":"which norm is checked","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased roles both encode norms as explicit structure, rules or ontologies of known distortions, and check decisions against them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Attending to rightness"}
{"body":{"matters":"length of the time horizon","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"The effective role stretches a decision over time and consequence, setting long-term worth against quick economy."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Attending to the horizon"}
{"body":{"matters":"depth of interpretation","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"The understanding role turns mixed data into situational meaning through structured vocabularies and inference."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Attending to sense"}
{"body":{"matters":"breadth of shared awareness","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"}],"prose":"The vigilant role watches across levels so that locally informed parts do not drift globally apart; it shades into the orchestrator."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Attending to the others"}
{"body":{"matters":"direction of flow between roles","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"The roles are wired into a flow: checks feed the balancer, meaning feeds the checks, watching spans all of it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Attentions feeding one another"}
{"body":{"matters":"when agreement is formed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009K"}],"prose":"Because no part gives up its own terms, meaning has to be made where parts touch. The question becomes when agreement forms, and how long it lasts."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The meeting point"}
{"body":{"matters":"which layer the mismatch sits in","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Before meeting can be designed, the kinds of mismatch and the layers they occur in are mapped: meaning, organisation, technology; data, service, process, business."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Naming the edges"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is shared in advance","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"}],"prose":"Agreement can be one shared format, one shared middle layer, or none at all with translation case by case. The last is the only one that leaves each part untouched."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Three ways to agree"}
{"body":{"matters":"lifespan of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"}],"prose":"Agreement is formed at runtime as a small, disposable vocabulary for one exchange, then thrown away or revised. Coherence becomes something renewed, not stored."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning made for the moment"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is presupposed rather than built","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"}],"prose":"The plumbing under the meeting, protocols, formats, security, is named but set aside as given, while standards and scale remain open burdens."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Ground assumed beneath the meeting"}
{"body":{"matters":"who holds authority over the joins","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009Q"}],"prose":"Once meetings must be made on the fly, someone has to make them; coordination gathers into a single role that binds the others, and the nest regains a top."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The arranger"}
{"body":{"matters":"kind of mediation performed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"}],"prose":"The proposed connector translates, aligns goals, merges data and settles conflicts; it carries no task of its own besides holding the rest together."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A part whose work is the others"}
{"body":{"matters":"which component does the linking","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"Inside, it is a small machine: a deciding core, a registry of what can link to what, a translator, a finder, and a builder and runner of workflows, with language models proposed for the reasoning and translating parts."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The connector's anatomy"}
{"body":{"matters":"where final authority rests","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"}],"prose":"Decentralisation is the stated aim, yet the arranger ends with the highest authority and may restructure everything below it. Distribution and apex sit side by side."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The top that returns"}
{"body":{"matters":"distance between the system and its double","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009X"}],"prose":"The idea is put to work once in a place and once in a rehearsal of that place, where the parts themselves become the actors that run and judge the run."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The whole enacted twice"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the simulated steer the simulation","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009W"}],"prose":"Inherited from agent simulation, a ladder is drawn from parts that only report, to parts that react, learn, and finally rewrite the simulation's own rules."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Simulation the parts direct"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is inherited from agents","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Emergent patterns from simple local rules, and agents that model, support or monitor simulations, are the ancestry; nesting adds levels to it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Lineage from agents"}
{"body":{"matters":"rung of autonomy over the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"Four rungs from passive data source to proactive rule-maker, with the practical demands of each."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The ladder of direction"}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity of the double to its part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Each part gets a double in a federation that shares time; the double plays users, flags discrepancies upward, and scores travel time, emissions and access."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The rehearsal in federates"}
{"body":{"matters":"where absence becomes visible","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200009Z"}],"prose":"The roles are cast onto travellers, services, infrastructure and a communication part; the place chosen is defined by what is missing in it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Mobility as the ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"which role each actor plays","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Every abstract role finds a concrete holder, and requests run a numbered path from user to routes and back under the arranger's control."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Casting the roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the absence of travel reveals","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Beyond routing, the system's second use is to locate places without transport, turning avoidance and silence in the data into a map of need."},"id":"1M6YBY3G200009Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Seeing the gaps"}
{"body":{"matters":"where the held text fails to join","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"}],"prose":"The held text has its own seams: two passages repeated under a different role, two categories whose descriptions trade places, and fragments cut off at page breaks."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000A0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The text's own joins"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much coherence is reached without central control, and whether the proposal stays conceptual or is tested","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000A3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000A8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"The whole reads as a proposal to extend holonic systems so that they hold ethical, effective, understanding, unbiased and vigilant roles, coordinated by one federating holon, and then to test that arrangement in simulation and in a single transport setting. It stays a conceptual framework that is argued for rather than measured."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000A2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A holarchy that trades pure efficiency for coordination"}
{"body":{"matters":"how nested autonomy is bounded by position in the hierarchy","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000A5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000A6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000A7"}],"prose":"Before any new role is added, the paper rests on what a holon is: a whole that is also a part, nested in levels of autonomy, with a lineage that began in manufacturing and spread outward. The pressures that make autonomous systems fall short are set against that ground as the reason for change."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000A3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The holon as ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"the balance between local freedom and directives from above","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"}],"prose":"A holon is autonomous in its own scope yet bound by the level above it, so authority is spread across the tiers instead of concentrated at the top. Local decisions align with system objectives through that bounded autonomy."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000A4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Nested autonomy within a hierarchy"}
{"body":{"matters":"the domain in which holarchy is applied and the kind of control it replaces","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"The idea starts with a philosophical notion of entities working at several levels at once, is taken up in production systems for flexibility against centralised control, and then spreads into smart grids, construction and cyber-physical work. Each step keeps the holarchy but changes the domain it serves."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000A5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Lineage from manufacturing outward"}
{"body":{"matters":"which failure mode is treated as the most serious gap","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"}],"prose":"Autonomous systems are described as brittle under change, prone to bias, short of accountability and thin on shared awareness. These are offered as the gaps the holonic extension is meant to close, and the case rests on them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000A6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Limits of autonomous systems as the spur"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much live data a holon can draw on while staying locally autonomous","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Digital twins, federated learning and AI models are presented as a way to give holons live data, fault tolerance and self-optimisation. The remedy is argued as compatible with holonic autonomy rather than as a replacement for it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000A7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"AI and twins as a remedy"}
{"body":{"matters":"which failure of a narrow optimiser each role is meant to answer","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000A9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AB"}],"prose":"The paper names five roles a holon can take on, each answering a particular failure of efficiency-first autonomy. Two of them pull against each other, three concern what a holon knows and how it watches, and every one of them carries its own difficulties in definition."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000A8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Five dimensions as roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"how a value is weighed when the short-term and long-term or the fair and the fast disagree","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"}],"prose":"Ethical holons and effective holons are set as a balancing pair: one guards fairness and safety, the other looks past short-term efficiency to sustainability and long-run outcomes. The two are expected to meet in negotiation rather than in a single rule."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000A9","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Ethics weighed against effectiveness"}
{"body":{"matters":"the fidelity of what a holon knows and how far that knowledge is shared","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"}],"prose":"Three roles concern what a holon knows and how it watches. Understanding is structured knowledge, unbiased is a check against distortion in that knowledge, and vigilance is shared awareness across holons that keeps local views from drifting away from the whole."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AA","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Understanding, bias and vigilance as knowing"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the criteria for a role can be written down precisely enough to be checked","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"The paper's own challenge lists show a recurring edge: a role cannot be implemented until its criteria are written down, whether those are ethical guidelines, effectiveness metrics, ontologies or bias patterns. The difficulty is less in the concept than in fixing what counts as success."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AB","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Where each role gets hard to define"}
{"body":{"matters":"the degree of autonomy a holon holds over the run it is part of","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AE"}],"prose":"Simulation is recast so that holons are both the entities being simulated and the agents that steer the run. The section sorts the ways this can happen by how much autonomy the holons hold, and argues that the directing role is a new step beyond agent-based simulation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AC","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Holons that direct their own simulation"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far a holon may alter the rules or objectives of the simulation it sits in","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"}],"prose":"Agent-directed simulation is taken over and sorted into passive, reactive, adaptive and proactive forms of holon-directed simulation, ordered by how much a holon may change the rules or objectives of a run. The sort follows the paper's own categories."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AD","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A taxonomy of holon-directed simulation"}
{"body":{"matters":"what distinguishes a holon acting in a run from an agent acting in one","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"The paper claims holon-directed simulation as a first formal use of the term and as a natural extension of agent-based work, with requirements for real-time adaptation and coordination. The claim is made largely by argument and analogy rather than by a worked method."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AE","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Holon-directed simulation as a new step"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far alignment can be negotiated at runtime rather than fixed in advance","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AK"}],"prose":"A single federated interoperability holon is proposed to hold the other holons together without a shared model or central authority. Its barriers, its modes of alignment, its functions, its component architecture and its open costs make up the bulk of the contribution."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The federating holon that binds the rest"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a shared representation layer is imposed or left out","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"}],"prose":"Interoperability is broken into conceptual, organisational and technical barriers, spread across data, service, process and business concerns, and then sorted into integrated, unified and federated approaches. The federated mode is singled out as the one that lets systems keep their own models."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AG","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Barriers and modes of interoperability"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long an alignment lives and how much of a holon's internals it must expose","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"}],"prose":"Federated interoperability is treated as something settled while the system runs, through short-lived ontologies, schema mapping and negotiated interfaces. The holon keeps its internal logic, and only the mediation between holons is dynamic."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AH","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Alignment negotiated at runtime"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of the connective work is delegated to language-model components versus fixed graph structures","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"The federating holon brokers communication, aligns goals, arbitrates conflict and reconfigures roles. It is then broken into six components, an orchestrator at the top and an integrator, translator, element finder and workflow pair beneath it, some of which can be left out."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What the federating holon does and is made of"}
{"body":{"matters":"which cost, whether standards, latency, or trust, binds first as the system grows","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"}],"prose":"Standardisation, scale, security and privacy, and cross-domain governance are named as obstacles that stand in front of the federating holon. Blockchain and AI conflict anticipation are offered as possible answers, without being built."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Costs the federating holon has not yet paid"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the setting is a demonstration of applicability or a measured result","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AQ"}],"prose":"A rural transport setting is chosen to show the framework working: the holons are mapped onto travellers, services and monitors, and the federated run is described step by step. The case is offered as an instance of the concepts, not as a validation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Rural mobility as the test field"}
{"body":{"matters":"the spatial gaps in transport that the system is meant to expose","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"}],"prose":"Rural mobility is framed as a problem that central planning serves badly, and the platform is meant to reveal where no transport exists at all. The functions listed are data collection, interoperation, desert discovery, adaptation and simulation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The rural case and the transit desert"}
{"body":{"matters":"the order of requests and updates and who holds authority at each step","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"}],"prose":"The mapping walks through one trip: the federating holon starts the federation, travellers ask, services answer with routes and prices, monitors feed in conditions, and the loop closes with validation and a report back to the user. Reports about avoided zones are also sent upward for planning."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AP","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Holons in the mobility loop"}
{"body":{"matters":"how errors are caught and whether the results loop back into the system's own strategies","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"The simulation is built on an HLA runtime, with federates standing in for the travellers, services and federating holon, and a federation manager that flags and invalidates faulty results. The run ends with a performance analysis of time, emissions and access."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The federation run through HLA"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of each part's own governing survives being made part of a whole","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BC"}],"prose":"The paper is one long attempt to let many self-governing parts, each also a part of something larger, work as a whole without a single ruler. It names the kinds of care a part must carry, the way unlike parts are bound, and the places where this is tried out."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AS","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Parts that keep their say, joined without a centre"}
{"body":{"matters":"the balance between local autonomy and the bounds set from above","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"A holon is at once whole and part, stacked in levels, with authority spread rather than gathered; the idea moved from a philosophical image through factory floors to grids, projects and data pipelines."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AT","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The nested whole and where it came from"}
{"body":{"matters":"where a part's authority comes from: position versus self","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000116"}],"prose":"The holon is drawn by contrast with the agent and the flat multi-agent crowd: same autonomy, but position in a hierarchy bounds what each may decide, and humans or orchestrators can sit in the nesting."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The nested form defined against agents"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the form carries beyond its home domain","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"}],"prose":"From manufacturing's early self-organising resources through energy grids, cyber-physical designs and construction scheduling, the form travels to wherever coordination is wanted without a centre."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A lineage of use"}
{"body":{"matters":"which shortfall is being named and what answers it","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000AZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"}],"prose":"Current autonomous systems are brittle when conditions shift, carry unseen bias, lack accountable reasoning and share too little awareness; the nested form, joined to learning twins, is offered as the remedy."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Why the gap is felt"}
{"body":{"matters":"the kind of harm a shortfall causes","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"}],"prose":"Brittleness in changing settings, bias from data and design, thin ethical reasoning, and poor shared context, each tied to sensitive domains."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Four shortfalls"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether capability can grow without gathering control","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Real-time twins, federated learning and predictive control give parts the data and flexibility to adapt and recover without central oversight, while ethics must be built in once authority is spread."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000AZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The promise of pairing with learning twins"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of the simulation's course the parts themselves decide","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B3"}],"prose":"The paper carries the family of agent-directed simulation over to holons: parts do not only populate a simulation but can shape how it runs, in degrees from passive to proactive."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Simulation steered by its own parts"}
{"body":{"matters":"which relation holds between actor and simulation","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"}],"prose":"Simulating agents, agents supporting a run, agents watching a run; simple local rules yielding large patterns; holons added as nested agents, and a new term coined for the step."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Inherited kinds of simulation"}
{"body":{"matters":"the degree of initiative a part takes over the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"}],"prose":"Holons may only report, react, learn, or rewrite the rules and objectives across federations."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A ladder of initiative"}
{"body":{"matters":"cost and standardisation against the hoped-for adaptiveness","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"Real-time role adaptation, coordination towards global optima, and the open costs: computation, standards and the tie to twins and learning."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What building it asks"}
{"body":{"matters":"which care a part carries and how it supports the others","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B7"}],"prose":"Each added dimension answers one shortfall by giving some holons a particular care: moral limits, long-run worth, comprehension, fairness, shared watchfulness. They are held to lean on one another and are conceptual roles, not fixed designs."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Five faculties of a part"}
{"body":{"matters":"the standard a decision is held to beyond speed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"Ethical holons bind decisions by rules and ontologies of principle against efficiency; effective holons weigh long-term and wider consequence against bare efficiency. Both struggle to define and measure their standard."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Care for what is owed and what lasts"}
{"body":{"matters":"the quality of knowledge a decision rests on","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"}],"prose":"Understanding holons turn scattered data into situated knowledge through ontologies and reasoning; unbiased holons name and counter known patterns of skew with audits and fairness limits. Both depend on building rich ontologies."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Care for what is known and what is skewed"}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment between local information and global state","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"Vigilant holons keep local knowledge aligned with the whole; the faculties then check, inform and watch one another across levels, summarised in a table."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Care for the shared picture, and how all five interlock"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much common ground is imposed versus negotiated","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BB"}],"prose":"Parts built by different hands, with different vocabularies, must still meet; the answer is a negotiated, runtime form of interoperability, embodied in a particular connecting holon."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Binding unlike parts with no ruler"}
{"body":{"matters":"what must be common before parts can speak","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"}],"prose":"Incompatibilities are conceptual, organizational and technological, touching data, service, process and business; solutions are one format for all, a shared layer, or transformation between parties with nothing shared."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000B9","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Kinds of mismatch and three ways of joining"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime of the shared meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006T6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"}],"prose":"Joining at runtime, with temporary ontologies used for one exchange and then dropped, lets a newcomer be understood and the whole reconfigure without restart; prior work is cited for support and for domain illustrations."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BA","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning made on the spot"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the connector does for the others, and what it declines to do","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"A holon set above the faculties to translate, align goals, integrate data, arbitrate and adapt; built of six components led by a language-model orchestrator; placed deliberately at meaning and organization, leaving technical plumbing assumed; limits named."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BB","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The connecting holon"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the abstract roles can be given concrete parts that cohere","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BG"}],"prose":"The whole is tried on sparse-area transport: roles mapped onto riders, services and road monitors under the connecting holon, then a standard distributed simulation whose federates mirror and test the live holons, finding places without service."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BC","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A trial ground in rural travel"}
{"body":{"matters":"the need the case answers","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"}],"prose":"Sparse populations, costly services and a call to coordinate modes and locate gaps in service."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BD","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The setting and its demands"}
{"body":{"matters":"which role does which work in the flow","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Each faculty is cast as a concrete actor; requests flow, plans are refined, authority rests with the connecting holon."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BE","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles mapped onto the transport system"}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between the test copy and the live system","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Holons are copied as federates over a runtime infrastructure; discrepancies are flagged upward, runs end with measured outcomes that feed back."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Simulation as mirror and test"}
{"body":{"matters":"the strength of the claim against the evidence held","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Strengths are scale, flexibility, fairness and lower emissions; the closing states the concepts as analytical constructs, not validated, and names the work still ahead."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BG","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What is claimed and what is left open"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is settled at runtime rather than at design time","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"}],"prose":"Everything the paper builds answers one pressure: a collection of parts must hold together while none of what holds it is fixed in advance, not the shared vocabulary, not the allocation of roles, not even who directs the trial run. Each column of the work moves some decision from design time to the moment of use."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Coherence without a settled centre"}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority sits","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BP"}],"prose":"The holon is inherited, not invented here: a unit that is a whole to what it contains and a part to what contains it, with authority running down the nesting and autonomy kept at every level. The paper takes this form as given and asks it to carry new weights."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A borrowed form: whole and part at once"}
{"body":{"matters":"position in the nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000116"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"}],"prose":"The distinction from an agent is positional: an agent is free in a flat field, a holon is free within a place in a nesting. Higher places command, lower places execute, yet each keeps a local say, and global behaviour is meant to arise from that constrained freedom rather than from a centre."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The pyramid that keeps its parts free"}
{"body":{"matters":"the domain the form has crossed into","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"The form was first put to work on machines, cells and operators in a factory, then carried into grids, building sites and supply chains. The paper's own move is one more step of that outward drift, to territories and the public services that cross them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"From the factory floor outward"}
{"body":{"matters":"which shortfall is named","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Four complaints are lodged against autonomous systems as they stand: they do not generalise when conditions shift, they carry bias, they cannot reason about responsibility, and they see too little of their surroundings. The holonic nesting is offered as the frame into which remedies for each can be slotted."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BP","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The shortfalls the form is asked to mend"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision can lack","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C0"}],"prose":"The five proposed dimensions are best read not as five kinds of holon but as five faults a decision can have: it can be wrong, short-sighted, uncomprehending, prejudiced, or blind to the rest of the system. Each fault is given a part whose job is to catch it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Five ways a decision can fall short"}
{"body":{"matters":"the quality a single part carries","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BX"}],"prose":"Each dimension is presented on the same template: a lack in current systems, a holon named for the quality, a method of ontologies and models, two domains of example, two challenges. The sameness of the template is itself a claim that these qualities are of one kind."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BR","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The five taken one at a time"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a rule forbids","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"}],"prose":"Moral and legal limits are to be encoded as ontologies and rules so that they can be weighed beside operational goals rather than after them. The part that carries them is meant to refuse opportunistic coalitions, not merely to flag them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BS","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Right and wrong as a constraint"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far ahead the cost is counted","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"}],"prose":"Efficiency counts the cost of reaching a goal; effectiveness counts what the goal costs afterward. The distinction is drawn as a difference in how far ahead a decision looks, and it is to be made operational with weighted utilities and goal hierarchies."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BT","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The horizon of a consequence"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much structure the input arrives with","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"}],"prose":"Understanding is defined operationally as turning heterogeneous, incomplete input into situational knowledge through ontologies and inference, with learned models allowed to enrich the symbols. The quality is less about insight than about structure imposed on arriving data."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning drawn from noisy data"}
{"body":{"matters":"where a bias enters","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"}],"prose":"Bias is treated as a nameable pattern: ontologies of known biases, fairness constraints, audits after the fact. The part that carries this is placed inside the decision loop so that checking is continuous rather than a review at the end."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Prejudice caught in the loop"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far a part can see","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"}],"prose":"The last quality is awareness of what other parts and the whole are doing, carried by distributed sensing and shared state models. A part may be well informed about its own task and still misaligned with the system; vigilance is the correction for that gap."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Seeing further than one's own place"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a quality can be told by its instance","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"}],"prose":"The vehicle and pandemic illustrations appear word for word under both the ethical and the effective dimension. The repetition is telling: by their instances the two qualities cannot be told apart, which suggests the boundary between them lives in the method, not in the world."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The example that would not stay put"}
{"body":{"matters":"defining, measuring, balancing","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Every dimension ends by confessing the same three difficulties: the quality must be defined, measured, and balanced against efficiency or speed. Read together, the challenge paragraphs are one admission repeated five times."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What each quality costs to make real"}
{"body":{"matters":"who feeds whom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"The five are given a flow: ethical and unbiased checks feed the effective decision, understanding supplies both with context, and vigilance watches over all layers. The flow makes the qualities a small holarchy of their own before any connector is introduced."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How the qualities feed one another"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much must be shared beforehand","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CB"}],"prose":"The paper's central proposal is that parts which were never designed together can still understand each other if agreement is produced when they meet and discarded afterward. A dedicated part is given the job of producing it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning made at the moment of contact"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is standardised in advance","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"}],"prose":"Systems can share one format, share a mapping layer, or share nothing and translate at the border. The three options are ordered by how much is standardised before any exchange, and the paper chooses the end of the scale where nothing is."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Three ways to interoperate"}
{"body":{"matters":"autonomy kept per part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"A nesting of autonomous parts cannot accept a global model without losing the autonomy that defines it, so the only interoperability it can bear is one negotiated at runtime. The argument is structural: the form of the system selects the form of the agreement."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Why the federated way fits nested wholes"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a shared meaning must last","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"A shared vocabulary is built for one task phase or exchange, used, and thrown away, a temporary contract rather than a standing dictionary. Its brevity is what keeps it cheap and what lets strangers join without a prior agreement."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning with a short life"}
{"body":{"matters":"how fast a system must re-form","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"}],"prose":"Across the examples the same figure recurs: an earthquake, an accident on the road, a supply disruption, a discrepancy in a run. Each is the moment a configuration ceases to fit, and the whole apparatus is sized for the speed at which it must re-form after that moment."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The unforeseen event"}
{"body":{"matters":"which organ each quality becomes","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"}],"prose":"The interoperability holon is introduced as glue between the five qualities and then, within a page, is found to be their superholon, with the five recruited as its organs: the unbiased part for retrieval, the ethical part as a validation layer, the vigilant part as orchestrator. Connecting things turns out to mean standing above them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The connector that becomes the top"}
{"body":{"matters":"which difference is bridged","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"}],"prose":"Five duties are listed: translate, align goals, pool data, arbitrate conflict, and reconfigure. Each names a different kind of difference between parts that must be bridged, from syntax to intention."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What a connector does"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is handed to a language model","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"Six components are drawn, and two of them, the orchestrator and the translator, are to be language models; the rest are a capability graph, a finder, and a workflow generator and executor that may be left out. How much of the chain is handed to a model is the real design variable."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Its anatomy, and the model at its heart"}
{"body":{"matters":"which barrier is claimed, which assumed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Placed against the INTEROP framework, the proposal claims the conceptual and organisational barriers and declines the technical one, which it assumes is already solved. The claim is narrowed to semantics and governance, the two layers where a fixed standard hurts most."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C9","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Where it claims to stand among the barriers"}
{"body":{"matters":"what was already built","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006T6"}],"prose":"An earlier framework from the same group supplies the three legs the connector stands on: AI for translation, simulation for validation, and mechanisms for adaptation. The present paper reads as that scaffold made into a holon."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CA","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The authors' earlier scaffold"}
{"body":{"matters":"cost per added part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"}],"prose":"The costs named are the ones that scale with membership: agreement on protocols, latency of semantic reasoning, exposure of sensitive exchanges, and the governance to hold it all. Prediction and ledgers are offered as partial answers."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CB","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What grows with the number of parts"}
{"body":{"matters":"who directs the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CF"}],"prose":"Simulation is turned inside out: the parts being simulated are also the ones steering the run, changing its rules and objectives as it proceeds. The novelty claimed is not a model but a change in who holds the controls of the trial."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CC","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The rehearsal in which the actors direct"}
{"body":{"matters":"which side of the run the agent stands on","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"}],"prose":"An agent may be the thing simulated, the helper of the simulator, or the monitor of the run. Holons inherit the three stances unchanged, and the paper adds a fourth word for the case where all three are held at once."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CD","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Three stances toward a simulation"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the actors may change the rules","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"From passive to proactive, the scale measures how much the actors may alter the run: supplying data, adjusting parameters, learning across runs, rewriting the rules. The implementation notes and challenges are the price of climbing that scale."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CE","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Degrees of direction"}
{"body":{"matters":"distance between actor and double","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"In the HLA setting each holon is given a federate as its double, and the connector's own double manages the federation with an authority that stops at the simulation's edge. Errors are flagged upward, results invalidated, and the run reinitialised, so the trial has its own small nesting inside the larger one."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Doubles under a limited authority"}
{"body":{"matters":"the gap between sketch and place","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CM"}],"prose":"A sparsely settled region is the single place where every proposed piece is assigned a position and a task. It is a sketch rather than a trial, and what matters in reading it is the distance between the sketch and the ground it names."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CG","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"One territory where it is laid out"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the absence reveals","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The second purpose of the platform is to locate places with no means of travel, which can only be seen as gaps in the routes the system computes. Absence is made visible by the shape of what is present."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CH","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Finding what is absent"}
{"body":{"matters":"which role each quality is cast in","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Each of the five qualities is cast in a role: travellers are understanding parts, transport services are unbiased and effective, infrastructure is vigilant, the communication channel is unbiased, and the connector holds the highest authority. The qualities become jobs the moment they meet a place."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The casting"}
{"body":{"matters":"the phase of the loop","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The system runs as a cycle: initialise the federation and its policies, exchange requests and conditions, adapt and optimise, validate and return. The same cycle is then replayed inside the simulation block, so one loop stands for two."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The loop of a trip"}
{"body":{"matters":"the claim a sketch licenses","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"Scalability, flexibility, fairness and lower emissions are all claimed for the territory, each by appeal to a property of the architecture rather than to an observation from the ground. The discussion licenses the claims by the drawing alone."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What the sketch is said to show"}
{"body":{"matters":"what remains to be shown","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000MX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"The closing pages say plainly that the roles are analytical constructs, the case is not a validation, and the hierarchies, evaluation methods and shared ontologies are still to be characterised. The paper ends by listing the parts of itself that are not yet held."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What is admitted unfinished"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much direction a whole may give its parts before their autonomy is spent","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DA"}],"prose":"The whole is a field of wholes inside wholes, where each part keeps its own footing while a higher whole gives it a direction. The same lending of direction recurs at every depth of the held paper, from the frame down to the sentences."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A field of nested wholes"}
{"body":{"matters":"the rate at which authority falls off as one descends the nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"}],"prose":"Wholes are recursively nested, and the higher a whole sits the more it may decide, while lower wholes execute within their local latitude. The paper contrasts this pyramid with a looser distribution of authority, and the contrast is a claim about where decisions live."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CR","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Depth and falling authority"}
{"body":{"matters":"which capability a holon is for, rather than what it is made of","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"}],"prose":"The added dimensions are less kinds of thing than roles a holon can take on, each answering a lack the authors find in autonomous systems. Ethics, effectiveness, understanding, freedom from bias and vigilance are set beside one another and cross-wired into a recursive whole."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CS","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Five capacities a holon wears"}
{"body":{"matters":"the time horizon and range of consequence that count in a decision","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"}],"prose":"An effective holon is distinguished from an efficient one by the breadth and length of the consequences it weighs, including environment, society and long-run performance. Efficiency optimises a short window; effectiveness widens it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CT","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Effective holon and the horizon of consequence"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether ethics is a hard constraint or merely one weight among others","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"}],"prose":"The ethical holon is pictured as operating within encoded guidelines, so that moral limits are evaluated alongside operational goals instead of being traded against them. Safety, legality and harm-minimisation are the named anchors, with vehicles and healthcare as examples."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Ethical holon as bounded constraint"}
{"body":{"matters":"the richness of representation held against the effort of keeping it current","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"An understanding holon is a holon whose strength lies in holding structured knowledge, through ontologies and semantic inference, so that heterogeneous data becomes situational meaning. Its pull is toward richer representation and the cost that comes with it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Understanding holon and carried meaning"}
{"body":{"matters":"where bias enters the loop and whether it is checked there continuously","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"}],"prose":"Bias is treated as a recurring pattern that can be catalogued, constrained and audited inside the decision loop, rather than as a one-off defect. The unbiased holon is the place where such checks and fairness constraints live."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Unbiased holon and bias as a watched pattern"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether awareness is pooled across levels or stays local to each holon","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Vigilance is the shared awareness that lets local holons stay aligned with the whole, through distributed sensing and cross-level dissemination. Without it, parts are informed locally yet misaligned globally."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Vigilant holon and shared awareness"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much shared meaning must exist in advance before two wholes can speak","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"}],"prose":"Wholes built by different hands must still meet, and the paper holds that they meet by runtime mediation rather than a shared model or fixed standard. Binding is negotiated when needed, with a mediating holon carrying the meaning across."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Federated binding across heterogeneous wholes"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the binding holon acts on others versus only mediating between them","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"}],"prose":"A single holon is proposed to hold the binding role: it translates, aligns goals, arbitrates among partial conflicts and reconfigures workflows, while leaving the internal logic of other holons alone. It sits above the rest as the place where federation is coordinated."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The federated interoperability holon"}
{"body":{"matters":"which functions are kept, and whether connection or only execution is controlled","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"The binding holon is decomposed into an orchestrator, an integrator that records what each element can do, a translator, a finder, and generators and executors of workflows. Some of these can be left out, leaving the holon with control over execution alone and not over connection."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Parts inside the binding holon"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime of a shared meaning, from a single exchange to a standing vocabulary","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"}],"prose":"Meaning is made disposable: an ontology is built for a single exchange, phase or episode, used, and then discarded or revised. Version tracking and mapping rules keep successive short-lived states coherent with one another."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Short-lived ontologies as temporary contracts"}
{"body":{"matters":"which barrier sits where, and which of the three alignment approaches is chosen","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"}],"prose":"Interoperability is broken into barriers of concept, organisation and technology, and into integrated, unified and federated approaches. The paper places its own contribution on the conceptual and organisational side, treating technical links as an assumed layer."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Barriers and the three ways to align"}
{"body":{"matters":"the gap between what present systems fail at and what a holonic frame promises to close","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"The motive is a set of stubborn limits in current autonomous systems: brittle adaptation, bias, weak accountability and thin shared awareness. The authors read digital twins and learned models as an opening, and holonic structure as the frame that could hold them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Why the holon idea is pressed now"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the simulated entities are also the ones directing the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"}],"prose":"The simulation is not only a stage on which holons act; the holons also set and adjust how the simulation runs. The paper sorts this into degrees, from holons that only feed data to ones that rewrite the rules."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Simulation whose entities also steer"}
{"body":{"matters":"the degree to which holons decide the simulation's execution rather than just take part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"}],"prose":"Holon-directed simulation is ordered along a line from passive data sources through reactive and adaptive holons to proactive ones that change objectives. The ordering is offered as a typology of how much a holon may decide about the simulation's own execution."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Degrees of holon direction"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the rehearsal mirrors live operation closely enough to be trusted","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"The architecture is rehearsed inside a High Level Architecture federation, where federates stand in for holons and a federation manager reports discrepancies back up. The simulation is meant to test the system and to feed its strategies forward over repeated runs."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The HLA federation as rehearsal"}
{"body":{"matters":"the sparse, dispersed demand that the architecture must fit","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000D9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"}],"prose":"A dispersed countryside with thin transport serves as the single worked setting, where the holonic architecture is asked to find transit deserts and coordinate scattered services. It shows the frame applied rather than proven."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A rural mobility whole held as the test case"}
{"body":{"matters":"the ordering of request, response, monitoring and validation within each pass","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The mobility system is run as a repeating cycle in which traveller requests meet routing and pricing responses, infrastructure monitoring feeds in, a communication holon translates across organisations, and routes are validated before they return to the user. Metadata about services accumulates in a graph that speeds later lookups."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000D9","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The mobility loop from request to route"}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between asserted benefit and demonstrated result","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Several claims outrun evidence: the value of the dimensions is argued rather than measured, the mobility case is not a validation study, and many implementation hurdles are named but not met. The held space carries these as open edges beside the proposals."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DA","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What the paper leaves unproven"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the asserted gains are tied to indicators that have actually been read","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"The discussion reads the framework as scalable, flexible, equitable and environmentally kinder, and reaches these as properties of the design rather than as measured outcomes. The metrics named for evaluation are travel time, emissions and service access, not yet reported."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DB","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Claimed gains in fairness, scale and emissions"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much freedom the parts keep against how much unity the whole gets","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E5"}],"prose":"The paper keeps asking how many autonomous parts can behave as one whole when nobody holds the whole. Its answers are specialised roles, meaning negotiated at runtime, and simulation that both mirrors and steers the system, tried on one rural case."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DD","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Coherence without a centre"}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction authority flows between levels","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DH"}],"prose":"What a holon is and where the idea came from: a thing that is whole and part at once, stacked in levels, carried from factories out into other infrastructure."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DE","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The nested part-whole ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority sits relative to autonomy","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000116"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"}],"prose":"Holons sit in a holarchy, free locally and bound upward, unlike flat agents and unlike rigid hierarchies. Humans and orchestrators can take places in it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Nested autonomy"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the idea travels beyond its first domain","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"The idea passes from Koestler to manufacturing, then to grids, construction and cyber-physical settings, each time as a way to manage complexity."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DG","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A lineage widening outward"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is already held versus what is missing","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000MX"}],"prose":"Earlier work on holon frameworks, awareness and understanding dictionaries is cited, with a gap left in large-scale cross-system cooperation, and a map of what follows."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DH","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Prior pieces the paper builds on"}
{"body":{"matters":"which lack is named, and whether a remedy answers it","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DM"}],"prose":"Autonomous systems are taken to fall short in four ways, and pairing holons with AI and twins is offered as the remedy."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The felt shortfalls and the promise of union"}
{"body":{"matters":"the kind of harm a lack lets through","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"}],"prose":"Rigid adaptation, embedded bias, thin ethical reasoning and shallow situational awareness, each stated as a risk to people and to trust."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Four named lacks"}
{"body":{"matters":"how well the two supply what the other lacks","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Twins and AI supply live data, learning and resilience, and holons supply distributed responsibility, so each covers the other's weak side. Ethical safeguards matter more where authority is spread out."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Why holons, AI and twins fit"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether each role closes a distinct gap","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DT"}],"prose":"Five capacities are drawn out as kinds of holon, and each is described by the gap it answers, how it could be built, where it applies and what makes it hard. They check and feed one another and a watching layer ties them together."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A family of complementary roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"how a norm becomes something checkable","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased holons hold judgement over right and wrong and over fairness, using ontologies of norms and of bias patterns plus audits."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DP","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles that hold values"}
{"body":{"matters":"the horizon a decision is made across","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"Effective holons look past quick efficiency to long-term consequence, and understanding holons turn varied data into situational meaning through ontologies and reasoning."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles that hold capability"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far awareness is shared across the whole","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Vigilant holons spread awareness across levels so that locally informed parts do not drift apart globally."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DR","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The role of shared watching"}
{"body":{"matters":"who supplies whom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"Value holons pass verdicts to the effective ones, understanding feeds both, and vigilance runs through all layers, so autonomy and collective aims hold together."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DS","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How the roles lean on each other"}
{"body":{"matters":"claim strength versus concreteness","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"}],"prose":"Each role is introduced as a response to a stated gap, and the paper treats them as analytic constructs rather than finished implementations."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DT","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The shared frame of the roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether differences are removed or bridged","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E0"}],"prose":"Because holons differ in vocabulary, model and owner, they need a way to interoperate that leaves their autonomy intact. The paper's answer is a particular holon built for the job."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning crossing boundaries"}
{"body":{"matters":"what each approach costs in independence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"Interoperability is a requirement; it is classed by barrier, concern and approach, and the federated approach alone leaves each party its own structure."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Why union by federation"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a shared meaning has to last","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006T6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"On-the-fly alignment lets a newcomer be understood without prior agreement, through temporary ontologies that are made, used and dropped."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Agreement made at the moment of need"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the mediator may reshape connections","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000DZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"The Federated Interoperability Holon sits above the roles, brokering translation, goals, data and conflicts, and is built of six components (orchestrator, integrator, translator, finder, generator, executor), with the last two optional."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The mediating holon and its parts"}
{"body":{"matters":"which role answers which duty","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"}],"prose":"The mediator needs unbiased holons for retrieval, ethical checks on outputs, and vigilant holons as orchestrators, so the earlier roles become its subparts."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000DZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"How the mediator draws on the roles"}
{"body":{"matters":"scope claimed versus scope left to others","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Examples in cities and supply chains, the limits of standards, scale and security, and a statement that the work targets meaning and organisation, with technical layers assumed."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Where it applies and what limits it"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the holons control the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E4"}],"prose":"The paper stretches agent-directed simulation into holon-directed simulation, where holons act in a run and also steer it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Simulation that directs"}
{"body":{"matters":"what holons add to the agent case","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"}],"prose":"Three agent-and-simulation pairings, with emergence examples, give the base, and holons add levels and organisational awareness."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Lineage from agent-directed simulation"}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of influence over the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"}],"prose":"A ladder from passive source through reactive and adaptive to proactive, graded by the autonomy of the holons."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Kinds of holon-directed simulation"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the idea costs to run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"It needs real-time adaptation, coordination, and federation, and it faces cost, standards and integration with learning and twins."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What it asks for"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the case exercises the whole framework","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000E9"}],"prose":"Rural mobility serves as the case: a sparse setting that needs coordination of many services and finds places with no transport."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"One concrete place"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the setting demands","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"}],"prose":"Low density and cost make centralised transport fail, and the platform must gather data, coordinate providers, locate deserts, adapt and validate by simulation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The problem and its asks"}
{"body":{"matters":"which holon plays which part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Each role gets a job in the transport flow, from travellers to infrastructure monitors, under the mediating holon at the top."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Roles placed in the scene"}
{"body":{"matters":"how test and real system stay linked","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Under the HLA, holons run as federates with a limited manager that serves as both authority in the run and part of the real system. Errors are flagged upward and a closing analysis feeds back."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The same holons as federates"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the case supports versus how much remains to test","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"}],"prose":"It is said to show scalability, flexibility, fairness and lower emissions, while being only an illustration, with validation and other domains left for later."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000E9","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What the case is said to show"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a tie is allowed to last","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F3"}],"prose":"The whole the paper draws is an order whose parts persist while the ties between them do not: meanings, goals, workflows and federations are made at the moment they are needed and released once the need has passed. Every section returns to this one move, replacing a structure that must exist beforehand with one that arises and recedes."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EB","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Binding made for the occasion"}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority stops","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ED"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EG"}],"prose":"A pyramid is drawn with the greatest authority at its top, and in the same breath that authority is reduced to the right to synchronise and restructure, never to command an interior. The highest holon in the paper is also the one most insistently said not to replace anyone."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EC","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Authority that does not own"}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of autonomy","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"}],"prose":"The holarchy is introduced as a pyramid in which lower levels execute directives from above, and is immediately re-described as a distribution of responsibility that preserves local autonomy. Later the holons are allowed to be not fully autonomous at all, their degree of freedom set by position and objective."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000ED","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The pyramid and its softening"}
{"body":{"matters":"coordination without control","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The interoperability holon oversees, binds, arbitrates, aligns goals and restructures workflows, and holds what the case study calls the highest authority. It is at the same time declared a supra-holonic mechanism that enforces no uniform behaviour and never reaches into another holon's logic."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EE","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The coordinator above the holons"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the coordinator may reach into connectivity","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"New elements are entered as nodes in a capability graph, found there on request, linked into a workflow blueprint and executed. The last two links may be removed, leaving a coordinator that controls execution but cannot change who is connected to whom."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The component chain and its detachable tail"}
{"body":{"matters":"the scale at which authority is read","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Inside the coordinator its orchestrator is a superholon to the coordinator's own parts; inside the simulation a federate twin of the coordinator holds authority limited to the simulation while remaining its subholon. The same shape of authority repeats at each scale, and the simulated holon is both the actor and the thing acted on."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EG","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Authority mirrored at smaller scales"}
{"body":{"matters":"design time against runtime","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"}],"prose":"Shared standards, common meta-models and comprehensive ontologies are set aside in favour of agreements struck between two holons at the moment they meet. What is fixed is moved from design time to the encounter itself."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EH","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning settled at runtime"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much must be shared beforehand","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"Interoperation can be had by everyone adopting one format, by everyone mapping to one shared layer, or by translating between pairs with nothing shared at all. The third is kept because the first two impose a global constraint that forbids a part from evolving on its own."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Three ways to interoperate, one kept"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"A shared vocabulary is made for a task phase, an episode or a single exchange, used, and then discarded or updated, with versioning letting several states coexist. Semantic coherence is kept without a repository that must be maintained for all time."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Short-lived ontologies as temporary contracts"}
{"body":{"matters":"which capacity of the model is drawn on","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"}],"prose":"Among the abstract components, two are given a concrete body: a large language model fills the orchestrator for its reasoning and the translator for its adaptability to new inputs. The same kind of model is drawn on twice for different capacities."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The one technology given a name"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a name is attached to","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ET"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EX"}],"prose":"Five named capabilities are first qualities a decision ought to have, then become components inside the coordinator, then become travellers, buses and roads in a mobility scene. The name survives each descent; what it is attached to does not."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Names that change body with scale"}
{"body":{"matters":"which failure each capability answers","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ER"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ES"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"}],"prose":"A list of what current autonomous systems lack is answered by a list of holon types, each type named for the lack it addresses. The pairing is nearly one to one, with efficiency-only thinking added as a lack of its own."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EP","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Failures answered one by one"}
{"body":{"matters":"what counts as wrong","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased holons are both built on an ontology of what is wrong, one of harms and rules, the other of known bias patterns, and both pass their verdicts forward to whoever balances. Defining the wrong is named as the hardest part of each."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The checking pair"}
{"body":{"matters":"length of the horizon","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"An efficient holon reaches its goal with least resource; an effective one lengthens the horizon to take in consequence, society and sustainability, and is harder to measure for exactly that reason."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000ER","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Effective against efficient"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether knowing is local or shared","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"}],"prose":"Understanding holons build situational knowledge from heterogeneous data inside themselves; vigilant holons distribute awareness across levels so that locally informed parts stay globally aligned. One is the interior of knowing, the other its circulation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000ES","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Knowing within and knowing across"}
{"body":{"matters":"what function a capability performs for the coordinator","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"}],"prose":"Inside the coordinator the unbiased holon becomes a dictionary that keeps retrieval accurate, the ethical holon a validation layer or a guard against leaks, the vigilant holon the orchestrator itself, and the effective and efficient ones subsystems that need a cue to know when to act."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000ET","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The five re-cast as components"}
{"body":{"matters":"who in the scene carries which capability","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"In the mobility case the capabilities become people and things: travellers are understanding holons, transport services are unbiased and effective ones, roads and weather are vigilant, the channel to outside organisations is unbiased, and ethical and unbiased holons set policy before anything moves."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The five as actors in a scene"}
{"body":{"matters":"where there is nothing to coordinate","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"Rural mobility is the single setting worked through: dispersed and unpredictable demand, services too costly to run on a timetable, and a second aim beside routing, which is to find the places where there is no transport at all to coordinate."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The one scene held still"}
{"body":{"matters":"direction of flow between capabilities","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"}],"prose":"The checks feed the balancer, the interpreter feeds both, and the watcher spans every layer; in the emergency scenes each domain is handed to one capability. The relations are drawn as flows between named roles rather than as a hierarchy."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The five among themselves"}
{"body":{"matters":"what happens when something breaks","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EW"}],"prose":"Nearly every illustration opens with something breaking: an incident, an earthquake, a pandemic, a geopolitical shock, a route that fails validation. The system is defined less by what it does when things go well than by what it rearranges without stopping when they do not."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A system known by its interruptions"}
{"body":{"matters":"continuity through change","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Holons may be added, removed or modified, workflows regenerated and roles reassigned while the system keeps running; a disruption is met by reconfiguration rather than by reprogramming. How far the coordinator may reach into connectivity is itself left adjustable."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Rearranging without restarting"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a discrepancy does","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"The simulation replaces the users' calls and tests the platform's answers, with each holon replicated as a federate joined to its live counterpart. A discrepancy anywhere is flagged upward, invalidates the result and may send the whole federation back to its beginning."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The simulation as rehearsal"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the actor steers its own stage","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"}],"prose":"Holons in a simulation may only report, may respond, may learn from past runs, or may rewrite the rules and objectives of the run itself. The ladder measures how much the simulated thing is allowed to steer its own stage."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Four grades of steering"}
{"body":{"matters":"which scene is used to show a capability","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"}],"prose":"Smart cities, healthcare, supply chains, disaster response and autonomous vehicles return in every section as the backdrop against which a capability is shown. The entrance is almost always an emergency."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The same few stages"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is inherited and what is new","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F8"}],"prose":"The paper's novelties are produced by putting one word where another stood, by extending a lineage one step, and by drawing a careful line around what is not being claimed. Reading it means seeing which of its parts are inherited, which are moved, and where the moving shows."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"New things made by substitution"}
{"body":{"matters":"how far back the idea reaches","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"}],"prose":"The idea runs from Koestler's nested wholes through manufacturing systems of the 1990s to grids, construction sites and cyber-physical plants, and the authors' own earlier work on understanding and on federated interoperability is folded in as the most recent step."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A lineage carried forward"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the substitution adds","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Agent-directed simulation has three kinds; because holons are taken to be a special class of agent, holon-directed simulation is given the same three by inference, and the term is claimed as used formally for the first time. What the substitution adds is organisational awareness and coordination across levels."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Holon put where agent stood"}
{"body":{"matters":"the line between claimed and deferred","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Technical interoperability is assumed rather than contributed, two components of the coordinator may be dropped, the case study is said not to be a validation, and empirical testing is named as absent. Standardisation, scale, security and governance are listed as challenges and left for others."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What is set outside the claim"}
{"body":{"matters":"where the seams lie","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"}],"prose":"The examples under effective holons are those under ethical holons word for word; the organisational and technology barriers carry each other's definitions; a sentence in Sect. 3 breaks off and resumes in Sect. 3.2; empty bullets stand in the coordinator's architecture. The text keeps the marks of having been put together from parts."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Where the assembly shows"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the holon draws in from outside","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"}],"prose":"Digital twins supply live data and virtual counterparts, AI supplies prediction and learning, federated learning supplies adaptation without pooling data; these are the motives offered for extending the holon at all, and the integration with them is also listed as still to be explored."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What the holon draws in from outside"}
{"body":{"matters":"where coherence is held","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000G1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000G3"}],"prose":"Underneath the proposal is one recurring problem: how parts that keep their own logic can still act as one. The paper answers it by relocating where coherence lives, sometimes up in a coordinator, sometimes in meaning agreed for a moment, sometimes in qualities installed as parts, sometimes in a rehearsal of the system by itself."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FA","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A whole that keeps moving its center"}
{"body":{"matters":"who may decide for whom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FG"}],"prose":"Authority is first placed by rank in a nested pyramid, then said to be spread across levels, then gathered again into a coordinating holon that is called the highest authority yet denied central control."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FB","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The address of authority"}
{"body":{"matters":"position in the nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000116"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"}],"prose":"The starting picture: each holon a whole to what it contains and a part to what contains it, its freedom bounded by its position."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FC","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Nesting as the given order"}
{"body":{"matters":"binding without owning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FE"}],"prose":"The interoperability holon binds every other holon toward an objective and sits atop the use case, while the text insists it leaves each holon's inner logic untouched and replaces no one."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FD","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A center that disclaims being one"}
{"body":{"matters":"the route from request to linked elements","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FF"}],"prose":"Coordination is made concrete as six parts: one that decides, one that records every element in a graph of possible links, one that translates, one that finds, one that designs a workflow, one that runs it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FE","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The machinery of joining"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the deciding part rests on","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"}],"prose":"Both the deciding part and the translating part are given to a large language model, for its reasoning and its adaptability to new inputs."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"A language model at the core"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is handed over","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"Autonomy is never all or nothing: holons range from mere data sources to rule-changers, and stakeholders may remove the coordinator's power to reshape connections, leaving it only to run what exists."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FG","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Autonomy as a dial"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long an agreement on meaning lasts","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FP"}],"prose":"Parts that speak differently are joined not by one shared language but by translations negotiated at the moment of meeting, though lasting shared vocabularies and standards keep returning."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FH","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Meaning agreed per encounter"}
{"body":{"matters":"how much sameness is demanded","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"One format for all, a common layer above all, or pairwise transformation with neither; the third is chosen because the first two press every participant into the same shape."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Three ways to share meaning"}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of a vocabulary","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"Temporary ontologies are built for one task or episode, used, then dropped or revised, so that a newcomer can be understood without prior agreement."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Vocabularies made to be discarded"}
{"body":{"matters":"what must not be renegotiated","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Ethics, bias and understanding are to be encoded in comprehensive, stable ontologies, and future work asks for shared ones, standing against the transient meaning used between holons."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The counter-current of lasting ontologies"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a name stays bound to what it names","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"}],"prose":"In the reading itself, labels and what they denote sometimes come apart: barrier categories carry each other's descriptions, and one dimension's examples repeat another's word for word."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Names loosening from their content"}
{"body":{"matters":"what the federation still presupposes","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"}],"prose":"Though meaning is to be negotiated without uniform standards, standardized protocols, shared formats, security and scale reappear as conditions the federation still depends on."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FP","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The standard that keeps returning"}
{"body":{"matters":"which capacity is made a part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FW"}],"prose":"Capacities one would expect of a whole system, such as conscience, foresight, comprehension, fairness and watchfulness, are each given their own holon, so a virtue becomes a component that can be placed, wired and checked."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Qualities turned into parts"}
{"body":{"matters":"the deficit being answered","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Every quality is introduced as the answer to a named deficit of current autonomous systems."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FR","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Each lack summons an organ"}
{"body":{"matters":"what each quality guards against","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"}],"prose":"The five qualities, each stated by what goes wrong without it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FS","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Five organs"}
{"body":{"matters":"the flow of checks between qualities","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"}],"prose":"The qualities feed and check one another: judgments of right and fairness pass to the one weighing the long term, comprehension informs them, and watchfulness spans all layers; where they conflict, a higher negotiation is called."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FT","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Qualities watching qualities"}
{"body":{"matters":"how qualities combine in one role","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"In the coordinator and in the mobility case, roles are composites: a traveller holon is an understanding one, a transport holon both fair and effective, orchestrators are called watchful by definition."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"One holon wearing several qualities"}
{"body":{"matters":"the missing yardstick","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Each quality carries an open problem of definition or measurement: what counts as ethical, how effectiveness is scored, how bias is found as it happens, how awareness is built."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"What the qualities cannot yet measure"}
{"body":{"matters":"the relation between a system and its rehearsal","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000FZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000G0"}],"prose":"Simulation is turned inward: the holons become actors in a copy of their own system, and the copy can stop, flag and send findings upward."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The system that rehearses itself"}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the modelled entity also directs","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"The line runs from agents whose local acts yield unplanned global patterns, to holons that also steer the run that models them."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"From emergence to direction"}
{"body":{"matters":"the mirroring of holon and double","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"}],"prose":"Each key holon gets a federate double, including a lesser copy of the coordinator that rules only the simulation while answering to the original."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000FZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Twin federates"}
{"body":{"matters":"what a discrepancy triggers","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"When a run diverges from normal operation, the place of the fault invalidates the result and passes it up; the run ends in indicators that may restart the whole."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000G0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Rehearsal that can refuse"}
{"body":{"matters":"the breadth of domain claimed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000G2"}],"prose":"The holon travels from a philosophical notion through factory scheduling to grids, construction and twins, each step widening the domain it is asked to order, and the mobility case is its newest ground."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000G1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"An idea widening its ground"}
{"body":{"matters":"detecting what is missing","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"}],"prose":"Beside routing, the mobility system is asked to find absence: places with no transport and zones people avoid, discovered as gaps in the flow of data."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000G2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"Sensing where nothing is"}
{"body":{"matters":"how strongly the claim is held","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000MX"}],"prose":"The authors place their roles as analytical constructs rather than implementations, and their case as illustration rather than validation."},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000G3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"],"name":"The paper's own standing"}